<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">Alago: Alago Bible Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">Oko</para>
  <para style="toc1">Oko ka Ayikoko</para>
  <para style="toc2">Oko</para>
  <para style="toc3">Oko</para>
  <para style="mt1">Oko</para>
  <para style="mt2">ka Ayikoko</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Otiyofilo:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 1:1">Ipu kokpa hin kikyikyo ntojoji kpiri ni Oyesu ya kpo oza ni ofase bwishi ni okwotu koko nu ni <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />weno ni ayo bize giso ni. Ome ana zo giso, oyoko kpo oshu ko Omaku ko Owuso kweyi pya ayikoko ko Oyesu ni oshu ni akpaha. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Eno awene itikpi kikwu nu obose dawa ishi lewewa owe lewewa ni sayi mo oyiyi kwokwoshi ni. Amo kweyi okela kpawa ikweyi ko obula ko Owuso. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Ishini agbayi ebye kponu ni, opyuwa akpaha mo: &lt;&lt;Alaka sho Ojerusele bita lo, ala ke bagye gbeyi keshi ni nka dala ma Ada hin shokoyi ko dala ni. <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />Oyohana yo obatisma kpinyawo, ipu ke eno gbayayi ake ba wa yala obatisma kpo Omaku ko Owuso.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Azo Oyesu Giso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Ishini ayikoko ko Oyesu wa gbayi kpo Oyesu ni, adoka mo, &lt;&lt;Adole, oya kwikye obula di Izrayila ishi mani la?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Oyesu kadawa mo, &lt;&lt;Ishi kwe eno ala ba gye lo, Ada hin pini gboshu koni la. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Omaku ko Owuso sa dala, ala ba nwonwu kpo oshu, kweyi ala bayo olobene hin ipu ko Ojerusele kpo Oyahudiya kpiri, kpo Osamariya, gipu kese kpiri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Ni okela kweyi ni, azo giso obutu wa; kweyi akpa yogwu amo kelo.<verse eid="ACT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Akpiyi kwiso bama ishini Oyesu ya giso ni, kweyi ebebeni ama asepa sho oshiye nehe hagye buwa. <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />Akamo, &lt;&lt;Ango ko Ogalili, ojiyala hagye ba miso? Oyesu ni ayo bize shala gipu kiso mani, ya kwikye yawa mamani byoni ala mo ya giso ni.<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ase ni zoko okwunu ko Oyahuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Ebeni ayikoko ko Oyesu kwikye bwe efu ko Zetu wa go Ojerusele, iyawu ni go osepa ko omeli oye bwogya nyaku ni. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Ishini afo ogya ni, kweyi ago oda ki iso ebe ni aba bagye ni. Awase ni gebe ni wo Obitrus kpo Oyohana, kpo Oyakubu kpa Andru, kpo Ofilibus kpo Otoma kpo Obatolomi kpo Omatiyu kpo Oyakubu oyi ka Alfayu, kpo Osimo ino dotose ko okpagye nu, kpo Oyahuda oyi ko Oyakubu. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Kpiri wa gbayi ba tinarigwu dudu ishi kpiri kpa anya kpo Omeremu ene ko Oyesu, kpa ayinanu.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Itikpi ke eno gbayayi Obitrus nyiso hagye otutehe kawase ni kyogwu ni ya kela, awase ogbogbo oye sawepa, <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />kweyi okamo, &lt;&lt;Ayene hin, Okpa ko Owuso wo kwokwoshi byoni oshu ko Omaku ko Owuso yo Odawuda Oyahuda ni myabo dawase ni yo Oyesu kwu ni, <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Oyahuda woye ipu kaha ayikoko ko Oyesu.<verse eid="ACT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />Oyahuda ro okpagye kpi ikwiri ni opye bwebe ko ozalabi nu ni. Ebeni ogbo gekwu kweyi ipu nu kya, ajifu nu kpiri bose ese. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Kpiri kase ni bo okpagye ko Ojerusele pwela mani, mani oni aba yokpagye ni ogwu okwunu ko ose wa mo Akeldama, ase nu wo &lt;&lt;okpagye ko oyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />&lt;&lt;Ayitota ipu ko Okpa ki Igye mo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">&lt;&lt;&lt;Ole nu na talakye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 1:20">ashishe naka yanu lo,&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">Kweyi akyi ta mo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">&lt;&lt;&lt;Ashe hoha na zoko nu.<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />Mani oni owotiri shini ahan shashe ipu kango ni baba kpaha bwishini Adole Oyesu yaha ba gyehe ni, <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />kwotu bwishi ni Oyohana ya tono koshu ko obatisma ni geno ni ayo Oyesu bize shaha giso ni.<verse eid="ACT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Mani oni aziye kase epa: Isu ni aba yo mo Obarsabas ni (aki gyo kpiye ko Ojostus ni), kpo Omatayas. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Ebeni kpiri wa tinarigwu mo, &lt;&lt;Adole awo gyotu kananoho, mani oni shiyaha ase ni awo shu ipu kase epa mani. <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />Shini ona wo oyikoko ko Oyesu okwunu ko Oyahuda ni shahabita gebe ni oshu ko yanu ni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Ebeni atekye kpiye kasepa, kweyi ekye gbo ikweyi ko Omatayas, ebeni ayo mipu ka ayikoko ko Oyesu igwoye oni.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s">Owowa ko Omaku ko Owuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Eno ko Opentikos, kpiri kase ni kyogwu kpo Oyesu ni gbayi ebe oye kponu. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Ebebeni apwegba bwakpa byeya kowu loshu ni yata, kweyi yole ni abanu ni kpiri yigwu. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Ebeni amoje byigbenu ko ola, kweyi awigbenu kola mani bose wasa dananoho wa. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Kpiri wa nwu kpo Omaku ko Owuso, kweyi akwotu ko kela awose gogo-gogo ni Omaku ko Owuso dawa ni.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Anani agbawase ko Oyahuda ni bo Ojerusele ni, awa bwo okpagye gogo-gogo ipu kese kpiri, agboshi ko Owuso kiso. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Ishini apwegba mani ni, ase lewa wa gbayi ebe oye kponu. Kpiri wa shotunehe ikweyi koni apwawo kyogwu ba kela okwunu ko ose wa. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Igbashi kwuwa kotata kweyi adoka mo, &lt;&lt;Awase ni ba kela mani wase ko Ogalili lalo? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Ojiya ni kpiri kaha pwuwa ba kela ose kaha? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Aha bwo Opatiya kpo Omidiya kpe Elamu, kpo Omesopotamiya, kpo Oyahudiya kpo Okapadokiya kpo Opontus kpa Asiya, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />ashini ka bwo Ofrijiya kpo Opamfiliya, ashini ka bwi Ijip kpa agye ko Olibiya ni yo kwo Osirin ni, ashini ka bwo Oroma, <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />kawase ni wo Oyahuda kpa awase ni wo Oyahuda lo ni, kpa pyopya gipu ko Oyahuda ni, kweyi ashini ka bwo Okrita kpa Arabiya, kwikyikyeni kpiri kaha pwuwa ba kawoza nyakwu no Owuso ya ni okwunu ko ose kaha!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Kpiri wa igbashi yuwa kwu kweyi agyoza koya lo kweyi aba diyiwa oka mo, &lt;&lt;Omani woji oni?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Ashishini wa ke ba yawo kyogwu eye kweyi ba kamo, &lt;&lt;Awa mani gwinyi ya!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ela ko Obitrus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Ebeni Obitrus nyiso hagye kpa ayikoko ko Oyesu igwoye oni, ozoko iso kweyi ka dawa mo, &lt;&lt;Ala ase ko Oyahuda, kpase kpiri ni bipu ko Ojerusele ni, nyya kela mani dala, ala ya akpaha tagye shini na nyalagbo kela mani. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Awase mani gwinyi byoni ala ba ka ni lalo; Omani wogye ahane kotukpokyi kin pini yoma! <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Omani ke wela ni inobane Ojuwel ka ikweyi nu ni mo:<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />&lt;Owuso kamo, oza ni nyya ya eno ko gwejeji ni yoma:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">nyya toleho ko Omaku hin ya dase kpiri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">Kweyi ayi kala nongo kpanya ba tono kela hin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">ayi kala nongo bamo osayi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">asawukye kala ba nana.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Kwayole hin ango kpa anya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">nyya yo Omaku hin tipu wa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">kweyi aba bane kela hin.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Nyya yawoza ki igbashi bwi iso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">kpo okpagye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:19">oyi, ola, kpiwola zobi;<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />eno ya pya dibu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">kweyi oya ya pya gola byo oyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">ome Eno nyakwu ka Adole kpi igyashi nu nawa.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Ebeni, ase ni shogwu ya Adole ko tabo, Adole ya ngmanu.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />&lt;&lt;Ala yakpaha tagye shini ala pwela mani, ase ki Izrayila! Oyesu ko Onazaret wase ni Owuso shu kweyi okyogwu kpanu bwebe kawoza ki igbashi ni Owuso ya dala bwebe ko Oyesu byoni ala abiyikala gyeni, ikweyi koni ogbodagye ipu kala ni. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Owuso kwobonu gbo mo aba yo Oyesu ya nabo dala; kweyi ala yawine kozalabi yongmo bwebe koyo poshi. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Owuso ke yo nyiso bwikwu, ongma nu showe kikwu kpo oshu nu, oyikwu gboshu ko yo shetu lo. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Odawuda kela ikweyi nu mo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">&lt;&lt;Nma Adole obutu hin ipu kishi kpiri;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">oyabore hin, kweyi nyya yoshi lo.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Ni olemani oni otu hin sha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">kweyi okwunu hin ya sho Owuso iye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:26">Koni ami, ya gekwu ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">nyya yotuso,<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />ikweyi koni oya nwanyi ami ipu ka aleku lo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:27">oya shoyole wo neshi bita na wowa ipu kamiri lo.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Oshiyami owe ko pyo olayi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:28">kweyi obutu wo nyya shotunehe.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />&lt;&lt;Ayene hin, owotiri na kadala kpoko nyakwu ikweyi ko okyikyi kaha ni agyo ni, Ose Odawuda. Ogekwu kweyi ayo nyi kweyi amiri nu yebe mani kpaha kwikyikyeni. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Odawuda ke winobane kweyi ogyoza ni Owuso shokoyi ni: Owuso gwene mo oya yoyi kipwoma nu oye ya wose, byoni Odawuda we ni. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Odawuda mawoza ni Owuso yawa ya ohobu ni, mani oni okela ikweyi konyiso ikwu ko Omezaya ishini okamo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:31">&lt;Ashobita ipu kawase ni gekwu ni lo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:31">ikpiye nu ya wowa ipu ka amiri lo.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Owuso yo Oyesu mani nyiso gbolayi kweyi kpiri kaha wolobene kokwokwoshi mani. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Onyiso kweyi ga yagye abore ko Owuso, Adanu, kweyi onyo Omaku ko Owuso byoni oshokoyi ni. Ozani ala ba ma kweyi ba pwo mani weshi nu ni oyi tipu kaha ni. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Odawuda abiyinu pini giso lalo; kweyi oke kamo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">&lt;Adole ka da Adole hin mo:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:34">&lt;&lt;Yagye abore hin ebe ni<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />gbishini nyya yawo omonyekwotu wo ba woka kikpo wo.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />&lt;&lt;Ni olemani, kpiri kase ki Izrayila na gye kwokwoshi mo, Oyesu mani nala yo poshi ni wase ni Owuso yo wa Adole kpo Omezaya ni!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Ishini ase pwoza ni mani, otu duwose kweyi aka do Obitrus kpa ashini ka ayikoko ko Oyesu mo, &lt;&lt;Ayene hin aba ya moji?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Ebeni Obitrus ka dawa mo, &lt;&lt;Ananoho kala na shagbotu kweyi ana yala obatisma oyoye ipu kiye ko Oyesu Okristi shini ana yozalabi kala gbala; kweyi ala ba pyeshi ko Owuso, ni wo Omaku ni. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Ikweyi koni Owuso shokoyi mani dala kpa ayi kala kpa ashini kase ni bebe lenu ni, kpiri kawase ni Adole kaha Owuso yuwogwu diyinu ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Obitrus buwa kweyi kela nwashika dawa mo, &lt;&lt;Ala ngmiyi kala shipu kowe ni yawa tase bibi mani ni!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Ase nwashika kyogwu kpela nu kweyi ayuwo obatisma, kweyi enoni ase gokpaku eta wa gipu kikpo wa. <verse eid="ACT 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Azishi wa ba foza bwebe kayikoko ko Oyesu, aba rema dudu, aba roza dudu kiba tinarigwu dudu.<verse eid="ACT 2:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oza yoya ka Awokyogwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Owuso ya ayikoko ko Oyesu yoza ki igbashi nwashika kweyi igbashi yase kpiri kwu. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Kweyi kpiri kase ni kyogwu ni gohobu ko rema dudu kweyi ayoza ni agbo ni yiko dudu kpiyi wa. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Ayoza kpiri kpiyo ni agbo ni yira kweyi yikwiri yiko da ananoho gyogye kpo oza ni oya doka ni. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Awokyogu ba gbayi kweneno ipu kole ko Owuso. Kweyi aba roza dudu kpotunehe ipu kolewa kpotu shosha, <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />aba sho Owuso iye, kweyi aba shotunehe kpiyiwa bwebe kase kpiri. Kweyi kweneno Adole yuwa ba nwashika, awase ni angmawa ni.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s">Ongo niya Pyepu-agye ni Pyo Ogege</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Eno oye, Obitrus kpo Oyohana yawu ba gole ko Owuso ogye eta kisheno, ishi ko tinarigwu. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Ongo oye ni ya pyepu agye bwishi ni amo ni yagye okwunu kofunu nyakwu kole ko Owuso ni aba yo mo Opunu Shoshi ni. Kurutu aba byo wofunu kowa bikwiri ebe kawo gipu kole ko Owuso. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Ishini omo Obitrus kpo Oyohana ba wa gipu kole ko Owuso ni, obuwoza. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Ayiyi kwo tiriri, kweyi Obitrus kamo, &lt;&lt;Maha!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Ebeni ongo oni yiyi kwuwa ya totuse manu ya pyoje bwebe wa.<verse eid="ACT 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Obitrus ke kadanu mo, &lt;&lt;Ngbikwiri ko dawo lo, oza ni nke gbo ni nyya dawo. Ipu kiye ko Oyesu Okristi ko Onazaret, nyiso sho yawu!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Ebeni onganu kpa abore kweyi tabo nyiso. Ebebeni ikpo kpa aworiho nu loshu; <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />oshibi giso kweyi hagye ikpo nu, kweyi kwotu ko yawu ebeni. Ebeni ogbosuwa gipu kole ko Owuso ya yawu, ya shibi, ya sho Owuso iye. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Ni ase kpiri mo ya yawu kweyi yasho Owuso iye ni, <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />ishini agye manu pini wino boza ni ya yagye okwunu ko Ofunu Shoshi ni la, igbashi yuwa kwu kpiri ikweyi koza ni gbodagye kpanu ni.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Obitrus Kela ipu ko Ole ko Owuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Ishini ongo ni gboso Obitrus kpo Oyohana gebe ni aba yogwu mofunu-ekpa ko Osolomo ni, igbashi yase kpiri kwu kweyi anyinya gebe wa. <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Ishini Obitrus mewa mani, okadawa mo, &lt;&lt;Ase ki Izrayila, ojiya ni omani woza kigbashi dala? Ojiya ni ala ba maha? Ala ma byo kposhu kaha kwe ebe koza neshi kaha pini ayo ongo mani yawu la? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Owuso ki Ibirayi kpi Ishaku kpo Oyakubu, Owuso kawo okyikyi kaha ni do Oyolenu Oyesu igyashi ni. Ala ke yo nabo dawine koshu kokpagye mo ana yo ngmo, kweyi ala tela nu obutu ko Obilatus, koni Obilatus yimu ko shobita ni. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Owase neshi ni gbepwo lo kweyi ala ke tela nu, kweyi ala mo Obilatus na shine ko ngmase bita dala. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Ala yase ni wotu kolayi yi ngmo, Owuso ke yo nyiso bwikwu. Aha wo olobene koza mani. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Oshu kiye ko Oyesu pini dongo mani ogege la. Ozani ala ma kpo oza ni ala gye ni gbodagye ni woko kotuse ipu kiye nu la. Byoni kpiri kala mani.<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />&lt;&lt;Nabani ayene hin, ngye mo oza ni ala kpa awoteyi kala yo Oyesu ni wikweyi koni ala gye lo ni. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Owuso kwobonu ka nekye-nekye bwokwunu kawobane mo Omezaya ya wa mowe; kweyi oyela nu gbodagye bwowe mani. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Mani oni ala shagbotu, shini ala kwikye webe ko Owuso, shini ona yo ozalabi ni ala ya ni yigbala. Owoni ala shagbotu, <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />ishi koshu ko Omaku yawa ni Adole kweyi oya to Oyesu ni wo Omezaya ni okwobonu shu dala ni. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Owotiri Oyesu na yiso gbishini Owuso ya wa kyojoji ya wo opepe byoni oshokoyi nekye-nekye bwebe kawobane nu ni. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Koni Omusa kamo, &lt;Adole Owuso kala ya tinobane oye oleho, byoni otumoleho ni, oya bwipu kala. Ala geyagye do oza kpiri ni oka dala mala ya. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Kpiri kase ni tela ko pwela nu aba yo ngma shipu kase ko Owuso kweyi yo ngmo.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />Kpiri kawobane bwikweyi ko Osamuwe kpa awase ni wa itikpi nu ni, kpiri wa kela ikweyi kishi mani. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Ala wayi kawobane bwebe kokoyi ni Owuso she kpa awada kala ni. Okadi Ibirayi mo, &lt;Bwebe kayi wo Owuso ya sase kese mani kpiri aboneshi.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Mani oni Owuso sho oyole nu kweyi toleho ikyikyo ebe kala, ko sala aboneshi bwebe ko yananoho kala na sho ozalabi kala bita.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s">Obitrus kpo Oyohana Bohobu ko Onongbo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Obitrus kpo Oyohana byela baka kpase, kweyi ashini ko osapa kpo oteyi kawogbeho kole ko Owuso kpa ashini ka Awosadusi wa tawa. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Ayanya kotata ikweyi koni ayikoko ko Oyesu epa mani bafase oza mo Oyesu nyiso bwikwu ni. Oni ya shiyase mo awase ni gekwu niba nyiso ba gbo olayi. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Mani oni ayo Obitrus kpo Oyohana kwu, ni eno shani, ayuwa kpo shoruduru ko gbokyi. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Ase nwashika ni ke pwo onototu ni kyogwu; kweyi anani ewa kawase ni kyogwu ni gokpaku eho.<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Ni ebenya ni awoteyi ko Oyahuda kpa anyakwase kpa awofono gbayi Ojerusele. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Agbayi kpa Anas ni wo Oteyi kawosapa ni kpo Okayafa kpo Oyohana kpa Alekzanda kpa ashini kase bwipwoma kawosapa nyakwu bebeni. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Abyo Obitrus kpo Oyohana wese wahagye obutuwa kweyi akwotu ko duwoka kela mo, &lt;&lt;Kposhu wonya kwiye wonya ni ala ba yoza mani?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Ebeni Obitrus, nwonwu kpo Omaku ko Owuso, ka dawa mo, &lt;&lt;Ala awoteyi kpa anyakwase! <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />Owoni ala ba daha oka kela ikyeni ikweyi koza neshi ni ayinon pyepu-agye kpoza ni yo pyo ogege ni, <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />kpiri kala kpase ki Izrayila alagye mo: Kposhu kiye ko Oyesu Omezaya ko Onazaret ni ala yo poshi, ni Owuso ke yo nyiso bwikwu nu pini ongo ni hagye obutu kala mani pyo ogege kpiri-kpiri la. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Oyesu pini wase ni okpa ko Owuso kamo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">&lt;Owikyikpo ni ala awomoda tela ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:11">anu pini wa wikyikpo ni shoshi she ni la.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Bwebe nu fufunu pini aba ngmase la, koni ashishe yaba ipu kese mani ni aba ngmase bwebe kiye nu ni kelo lo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Awonongbo mo Obitrus kpo Oyohana kela dawa gboshi lo ni igbashi yuwa kwu, koni agye mawase mani yinokpa lo, agye mo awawogboso Oyesu la. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Ishini amongo ni adanu ogege ni ke hagye ebeni kpawa ni, agege ko kojije kelo. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Ebeni aka dawa mana bose shekpa ka awonongbo kweyi ba kela kpiyiwa. <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />Adiyiwa oka mo, &lt;&lt;Aha baya moji kpo Obitrus kpo Oyohana? Koni ananoho Ojerusele gye mo ango mani yoza kigbashi nwashika, aba gege ba tawashu lo. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Shini oshu mani ke naka gakpaha kase ebebenya lo, owotiri shini ahan pyango mani akpaha ko kela ikweyi kiye mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Ebeni ayuwogu kwikye wipu kweyi apyuwa akpaha mo, ana ka kela kwe fase oza kpiye ko Oyesu kelo. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Obitrus kpo Oyohana ke kyogwu mo, &lt;&lt;Ala ka abiyikala onya shoshi ebe ko Owuso, an pwela kala kwe an pwa ko Owuso? <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Ikweyi koni aha ba gege ko yokwunu gwu ikweyi ko oza ni aha ma kwe aha pwo ni lo.<verse eid="ACT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Ni onongbo pyuwa akpaha kotata kweyi ni ayuwa mo ana gawa. Koni agyowe ni aba bwu ko gbuwogo agye ni lo, ikweyi koni ase ba sho Owuso iye ko oza ni gbodagye ni. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Ongo ni ayoza kigbashi ikweyi nu kweyi danu ogege mani shi ishayi awene la.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Awokyogwu Tinarigwu Ko Tono Gboshi lo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Ni asho Obitrus kpo Oyohana bita ni, agebe kasewa ga koza ni awosapa nyakwu kpa anyakwase ka ni. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Ishini awokyogwu pwo mani, kpiri wa zoko wa iso kpi inarigwu do Owuso mo, &lt;&lt;Adole, awo ni yiso kpo okpagye kpishu kpo ojoji ni yipu nu ni. <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />Kpo oshu ko Omaku ko Owuso oyo oyole wo ada kaha Odawuda kamo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">&lt;&lt;&lt;Ojiya awase ni wase koyahuda lo ni ba byotu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:25">ojiya ase ba gbela bibi ipu kotu wa?<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Awose kese mani wiyiwashu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">kweyi awoteyi kpikweyi gbayi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">ikweyi ka Adole kpo Omezaya nu.<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />Ohiridus kpo Opontiyo Obilatus kpawase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni kpase ki Izrayila gbayi ogya nyakwu kweyi agbela ikweyi ko Oyesu Oyole wo, ni oyo wo Omezaya ni. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Agbayi shini ana yawoza kpiri ni okwobonu gbo ipu koshu wo mo ana gbodagye ni. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Nabani Adole, pwoshi ni aba taha ni kweyi odaha oshu ko tono kela wo kpoko nyakwu. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Nabowota shini odase ogege kweyi yawoza kigbashi kpiye ko Oyole wo Oyesu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Ishini atinarigwu kweyi ni, ebeni agbayi ni ja. Kweyi kpiri wa Omaku ko Owuso gikpiye wa kweyi akwotu ko kela ko Owuso gboshi lo.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ojoji Wako Odudu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Kpiri kawase ni kyogwu ni otuwa woye kponu. Ashishe ipu wa ya kamo oza ni ogbo ni wakaka nu lo, ake yojoji yi ko dudu. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Awayikoko ko Oyesu gohobu ko yo olobene ko nyiso ka Adole Oyesu bwikwu. Kweyi oneshi ko Owuso yo kpawa nwashika. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Ojije nyashishe wa lo. Awase ni gbeho kwole ni yi kpora kweyi byikwiri wa, <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />kweyi ayi ikwiri dayikoko ko Oyesu, kweyi ayiko dananoho gyogye kpoza ni oya doka ni.<verse eid="ACT 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Ebeni Isu Olawi ni amo ogya ko Osipros ni ayikoko ko Oyesu ba yogwu mo Obarnabas (asenu woyi kotugbagba), <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />yeho nu yira kweyi byikwiri wobutu ka ayikoko ko Oyesu.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s">Ananiya kpo Osafira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Ongo oye ipu wa iye nu wo Ananiya kponya nu ko Osafira, yiyo wa oye ra. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Oke yashini kikwiri teba kpogyogye konya nu, kweyi byashini gobutu kayikoko ko Oyesu.<verse eid="ACT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Ebeni Obitrus ka danu mo, &lt;&lt;Ananiya, ojiya ni oyi Ibiri gipu kotu wo kweyi yo kokame do Omaku ko Owuso bwebe ko yashini kikwiri kiyo wo teba? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Ome oyiyo ra, owa kakawo lalo? Ni oyi ra ni, ikwiri wa kakawo la lo? Oji yo ya mani? Okokame dasuse la lo, oke kokame do Owuso la.<verse eid="ACT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Ni Ananiya pwela mani ni, ogbo okpagye kweyi gekwu; oshi yase kpiri ni pwoza ni gbodagye ni kwu. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Awisongo wipu wa yopa lanu, kweyi nganu gese ga yo nyi.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Ogyeta shigbo gitikpi, onya nu wipu, ogyoza ni gbodagye ni lo. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Obitrus doka mo, &lt;&lt;Ka dami kpiri koza ni asalore kiyo nala yi ra ni yona?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:8">Okyogwu mo, &lt;&lt;Olemani, oyu oni oma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Obitrus ka danu mo, &lt;&lt;Ojiya ni awo kpobu wo yokwunu kala pwayi ko mo Omaku ka Adole ma? Eya kikpo kango ni nyokwu kobu wo ni fowe kopwunu wa, aba wa ngawo ga mamani.<verse eid="ACT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Ebebeni, ogbo obutu nu kweyi gekwu. Awisongo wipu wa tanu wokwu, anganu ga yo nyi kwo obunu. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Ikpo kase kpiri ni kyogwu ni kpase ashini ni pwela mani yoshi kotata.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Awayikoko ko Oyesu Yoza Kigbashi Nwashika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Ebeni ayikoko ko Oyesu yoza kigbashi nwashika ipu kasuse. Awase ni kyogwu kpo Oyesu ni kpiri ba gbayi Oyikpa ko Osolomo. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Ashishe bwese tigiga tota ko gipu wa lo, kwikyikyeni ase ba koneshi wa. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Ase nwashika ke wa mikweyi wa, ewa kango kpanya ni kyogwu kpa Adole Oyesu ni. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Ikweyi koza ni ayikoko ko Oyesu ba ya ni, ase ba byawine kere gokwunu ko owe ga yuwa shagye ikweyi kogwudu kpote shini oyi ko Obitrus na bwikweyi wa ishini oya shigbo. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Kweyi ewa kasuse wa bwawogya ni bagbabo ko Ojerusele ni, abya wo gbere kpawase ni gbomaku bibi wa; kweyi kpiri wa pyogege.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayikoko ko Oyesu Megye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Ebeni Oteyi kawosapa kpawase nu, kpawase ni bikpo kawo Osadusi ba yanya ka ayikoko ko Oyesu. <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />Aya ayikoko ko Oyesu kwu ga yuwa shoruduru. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Oyoleho ka Adole ke wa yofunu ko oruduru yi gwa otu oni, ongmawa wese kweyi ka dawa mo, <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />&lt;&lt;Ala ga hagye ole ko Owuso shini ala koshu kpiri kolayi pepe mani dase.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Ayikoko ko Oyesu mani yoza ni oka dawa ni, ototukpokyi agipu kole ko Owuso, kweyi akwotu ko fasoza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Oteyi kawosapa kpawase nu yogwu ko onongbo nyakwu kanyakwase ko Oyahuda; ebe ni atoleho go oruduru koga byayikoko ko Oyesu wa. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Ishini awa ni, ama ayikoko ko Oyesu ipu ko oruduru lo. Ebeni akwikye ga ka donongbo mo, <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />&lt;&lt;Ishini afo oruduru ni, Aha topwunu boba neneshi kweyi awogbeho kpiri bofunu ko owe; naha ke gwofunu ni, aha mashishe yipu lo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Ishini awosapa nyakwu kpoteyi kawadakare ni ba gbeho kole ko Owuso ni pwela mani, oza mani yuwikweyi gbo, agyoza ni gbodagye kpa ayikoko ko Oyesu mani lo.<verse eid="ACT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Ebeni ongo oye wipu wa ka dawa mo, &lt;&lt;Ala ma! Ango ni ala kpuwa shoruduru ni bipu kole ko Owuso ba fasoza oma!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Ebeni oteyi kawadakare kpawadakare nu ga bya ayikoko ko Oyesu wa. Akwuwa koshu lo, ayoshi koni ase ba tuwakyo ni.<verse eid="ACT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Abya ayikoko ko Oyesu wipu wa hagye obutu ko onongbo, kweyi Oteyi kawosapa duwoka kela. <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />&lt;&lt;Aha pyalakpaha mala ka fasoza ipu kiye kongo mani lo, moza ni ala ke ya ni! Ala kwobonu yozafofu kala ge ebebenya Ojerusele wa, kweyi ala ba maha gbabo ipu kikwu kongo mani!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Ebeni Obitrus kpashini kayikoko ko Oyesu kyogwu kamo, &lt;&lt;Owotiri shini ahan geyagye do Owuso, wasuse la lo! <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Nala yo Oyesu ngmo bwebe ko yo poshi ni, Owuso kawokyikyi kaha yo nyiso ikwu. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Owuso zo ga yagye abore nu iso, wo Oteyi kpo Olowoyi, ko gwowe ko shagbotu di Izrayila shini ana yozalabi wa yi gbuwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Aha wolobene kawoza mani, aha kpo Omaku ko Owuso, ni weshi ko Owuso dawase ni ba geyagye danu ni.<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Ishini onongbo pwela mani, otu wa bya, kweyi aba yimu ko yayikoko ko Oyesu ngmo. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Ofarisi oye ipu wa iye nu wo Ogamaliyel, owino fono kweyi ase ba mogyiyi kotata, otakpa nyiso ipu ko onongbo. Omo ana ngma ayikoko ko Oyesu gese kishi gbayayi ome, <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />ebe ni oka donongbo mo, &lt;&lt;Ayene hin ki Izrayila, ala gbera kpoza ni ala ba yimu ko ya kpango mani. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Ala rela ko Otiyudas ni bose ishi oye ni shigbo ga ni, ya ziyinu manu washe nyakwu. Ase goza kogbogbo ene gboso. Ayo ngmo, awogboso kya, kweyi ikpo oni kweyi. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Itikpi koni, Oyahuda ni wase ko Ogalili ni bose ishini aba yase ka ni; ase nwashika gboso. Ake yo ngmo mamani, kweyi awogboso kya. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Mani oni, nyya ka dala, ala ka yango mani ojije. Ala shuwabita! Owoni oza ni aba gbo kpoza ni aba ya ni bwebe kasuse, oya hagye lo, <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Owoni oke bwebe ko Owuso la, ala ba gege ko gwuwagye lo. Abishi koni ala ba tiyi kala ba nonu kpo Owuso.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Aya ayikoko ko Oyesu ogwu wipu kweyi ayawadakare yuwaboshi. Ebeni apyuwakpaha mo ana ka kela ipu kiye ko Oyesu kelo, kweyi ashuwabita.<verse eid="ACT 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Ayikoko ko Oyesu mani shonongbo bita kpotunehe, ikweyi koni Owuso muwa gye ko megye kpowuru gbogbo ikweyi ko Oyesu ni. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Kweyi agohobu ko fasoza kweyi tono ko Oshu Neshi ko Oyesu Omezaya kurutu ipu ko Ole ko Owuso, ki ba bwole-bwole kasuse.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s">Ashase Ahapa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Ishini awogboso lewa ni, Ase ko Oyahuda ni ba ko ose ko Ogirik ni ba kakyose ikweyi ka Ase ko Oyahuda ni ba kose ki Ibru ni, amo aba gwa anyokwu wa tagye ebe koza ni aba ko dawa kurutu ko tuwabo ni. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Ebeni ayikoko ko Oyesu igwepa kpashini kawogboso kpiri tukpa ebye kponu kweyi kamo, &lt;&lt;Oya shoshi shini ahan shono totu kela ko Owuso bita shawu ko koza lo. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Ayene, ala shase ahapa ipu kala ni ala gye mo Omaku yo kpawa ni, ana wawase ni ziyi ni. Aha ba yoko mani ya nabo dawa <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />kweyi aha ba zishi kaha kpiri dinarigwu tota kpoko ko tono kela ko Owuso.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Ela mani shananoho otu, asho Ostivi, ongo ni nwonwu kpotuse kpo Omaku ko Owuso ni, kpo Ofilibus, kpo Oprokoros, kpo Onikanon, kpo Otimon, kpo Opaminas, kpo Onikolas, ase ka Antakiya ni gwiye ko Oyahuda ishi oye ni. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Abyase ahapa mani ga dayikoko ko Oyesu, kweyi atinarigwu kweyi suwabo ikweyi.<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Mani oni akela ko Owuso dase nwashika. Awogboso Oyesu wa nwashika Ojerusele, kweyi awosapa nwashika kyogwu kpanu.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayo Ostivi Kwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Ostivi wa ase ni gbo oshu kweyi oya awoza neneshi obutu kase. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Awashe ke ba yimu ko miyi ko Ostivi lo, abwekpa ka Awo Babo Kiyiwa, byoni aba yuwogwu ni, agbase ko Oyahuda bwagye ko Osirin kpa agye ka Alegzandiriya ipu wa. Awa kpase ko Oyahuda ashini bwagye ko Okilikiya kpa Asiya kwotu ko tawashu kpo Ostivi. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Omaku ke do Ostivi ela gyogye ni okela ashishe ya gege ya gwela nu agye lo ni.<verse eid="ACT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Ebeni aga rase mo ana kamo, &lt;&lt;Aha pwo Ostivi ya kela karigbetu ikweyi ko Omusa kpo Owuso!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Bwebe koni akwase ola otu, kanyakwase, kawofase Ono. Ayo Ostivi yi kwu kweyi abyo gobutu ko onongbo. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Ebeni aga byawo yolobene kokame wa yolobene ikweyi nu mo, &lt;&lt;Ongo mani ishi kpiri oya kela bibi ikweyi kole ko Owuso, kpo Ono ko Omusa. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Aha pwo ya kamo Oyesu ko Onazaret ya yo Ole ko Owuso ya kye kweyi oya yodu ni Omusa shibita daha ni ya yi pya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Ebeni kpiri kase ni bagye ipu ko onongbo ni kpiyi kwo Ostivi, kweyi amiyi nu le byiyi ko oyoleho ko Owuso.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s">Ostivi Kela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Ebeni oteyi kawosapa do Ostivi oka mo, &lt;&lt;Ela ni aba ka ikweyi wo mani wokwokwoshi la?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Ebeni okamo, &lt;&lt;Awada hin kpa ayene hin, ala ya akpaha tagye shala pwo! Owuso ine kigyashi bose da Ada kaha Ibirayi, ishini otayayo yo Omesopotamiya ni, ome ona go Oharan. <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />Owuso ka di Ibirayi mo, &lt;Shokpagye wo, kpase wo bita, shini ogo okpagye ni, nyya shawo ni.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />&lt;&lt;Ebeni obose sho okpagye kawo Kaldiya bita kweyi ga yagye okpagye ko Oharan. Ishini ada nu gekwu ome, Owuso kwikye anu wokpagye ni ala banu nabani. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Owuso ke di Ibirayi ogwu kokpagye ebe ni kwikpo oye lo. Owuso ke shokoyi mo anu yayo okpagye ni yayi danu kpayi kipwoma nu. Ishi oni Ibirayi moyi wa lo. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Owuso ka danu mo, &lt;Ipwoma wo ba wo ogboga okpagye oye, aba wa meshe, aba yuwono kishayi ogbogbo ene. <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Owuso ke kamo anu wa do okpagye ni yuwa meshe ni owe kweyi aba bose sho okpagye ni ba wa geyagye dami ebe ni.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Ebeni Owuso di Ibirayi oshu ko shofu na woyi ko okoyi. Mani oni Ibirayi shi Ishaku ofu eno komahata ni amo ni; mamani Ishaku shoyi nu ko Oyakubu ofu, kweyi Oyakubu shayi nu igwepa ofu, awa ni wa awada kipwoma kaha ni.<verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />Ayi ko Oyakubu ba yanya ko oyinawa Isu kweyi ayora gi Ijip ga meshe. Owuso ke yo kpanu <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />kweyi yi Isu ngma shipu ko owe moma nu kpiri. Owuso danu oneshi kpo oziyi ebe ko Ofirona ose ki Ijip kweyi yo woteyi ko okpagye ki Ijip kpole kose kpiri.<verse eid="ACT 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />Ebeni owe kpemye ngmase kotata okpagye ki Ijip kpo Okana kweyi ebe ni awada kaha gboza rore lo. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Ishini Oyakubu pwo mo izire yi Ijip ni, otayi nu awosoku kaha oleho gebe ni kikyikyo. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Na ga ko omwepa ni, Isu kada ayinanu aseni anu we ni kweyi Ofirona gyipwoma ki Isu. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Ebeni Isu toleho mana ga byada nu Oyakubu kpipwoma nu kpiri wa, awase awahapa ayeho. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Ebeni Oyakubu gi Ijip ebeni anu kpayi nu kpiri gekwu ni. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Kweyi akwikye okwu wa go Oshekem ga yuwa nyi ipu ka amiri ni Ibirayi ra kpikwiri nu abo kayi ko Ohamo.<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />&lt;&lt;Nishi kokoyi ni Owuso she di Ibirayi wa pee ni, ase kaha nwashika kotata agye ki Ijip. <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Ebeni ashe ni gyo ojije ikweyi ki Isu lo ni wa ro ose ki Ijip. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Ose mani gyawada kaha egya kweyi oyuwa kpayi meme shonu koshu shini ana gekwu. <verse eid="ACT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />Ishini amo Omusa ni oma, oyi shoshi kyarigada. Abyo koya eta ole kada nu. <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />Ishini aga yo teba ni, oyi ko Ofirona nonya ga yo bize, wa byo woyi nu. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Kweyi afo Omusa oziyi ko yoza kpela gyogye kase ki Ijip kweyi owa wase ni gboshu ipu kela koka kpoza yoya.<verse eid="ACT 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />&lt;&lt;Ishini Omusa gyishayi awene ni, ebe ni ogbo otu nu ko mo oneshi kase nu nu ki Izrayila. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Omase ki Ijip ya gwoyi ki Izrayila, Omusa ga nyokwu nu koyi ki Izrayila kweyi yoyi ki Ijip ngmo. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Omusa ma byo ase nu bagye mo Owuso ya yoko kpanu ko ngmawa, ake gye lo. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Eno komweta Omusa wa mayi ki Izrayila epa ba nonu kpiyiwa. Oya kuwoka mo, &lt;Ango ala wayine la, ojiya ni ala ba nonu kpiyi kala?&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Ase ni oshunu sha ko oyinanu ni so Omusa abo kweyi kamo, &lt;Anoho yo wose kpino kepwo ikweyi kaha? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Oya yimu ko yun ngmo byoni ongmo ongo ki Ijip ene ni la? <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Ishini Omusa pwo mani ni, onyinya go Omidiya, ebe ni oga wo ogboga kweyi omayi nongo epa ebe ni.<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />Itikpi kishayi awene, oyoleho ko Owuso bose do Omusa ipu kigbenu kola ipu ni ya kye ikweyi kefu niyo pee kpe Efu ko Osinayi ni. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Ishini Omusa moza mani ni, igbashi yo kwu. Oshaga koga ma, opwoko ka Adole ya kamo, <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />&lt;Ami pini wo Owuso kawada kala, Owuso ki Ibirayi, Owuso ki Ishaku kpo Owuso ko Oyakubu.&gt; Ebeni oshi yo Omusa kwu, kweyi ogege ma lo. <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Ebeni Adole kadanu mo, &lt;Yo okpabawu wo ngma, ebe ni ohagye anu ni wagye sere la. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Nmase hin ke ba mowe ko kwokwoshi Ijip. Npwegba kyokye wa kweyi nwa ko wa ngmawa. Wa anani, nyya toleho gi Ijip.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />&lt;&lt;Omani wo Omusa ni ase ki Izrayila tela nu ni, &lt;Anoho sho woteyi kwe inokepwo kaha? Anu pini Owuso abiyinu toleho mona woteyi kpino ngmase bwebe koyoleho ko Owuso ni bose danu ipu efu ni ya kyola ni. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Ongmawa sho okpagye ki Ijip kweyi oyawoza kigbashi kweyi ongmawa bwishu nowa kpo ododa kishayi awene. <verse eid="ACT 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />Omusa abiyinu pini ka dayi ki Izrayila mo, &lt;Owuso ya ti inobane byami ya wa bwipu kase kala.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Oyipu kogbayi ipu ko ododa kpo oyoleho ni kela danu ikweyi ke Efu ko Osinayi kpa awada kaha, kweyi onyela kolayi wawa daha.<verse eid="ACT 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />&lt;&lt;Awada kaha tela ko geyagye danu. Ake tela nu kweyi aba yimu ko kwikye gi Ijip. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Aka da Aruna mo, &lt;Yaweka daha ni ya kpahogwu ni, ikweyi koni Omusa ngmaha shokpagye ki Ijip, aha gyo oza ni tanu ni lo.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Ishi oni pini ayeka byoyi kena, aba peshi kweyi ba rimya do oza ni aya kpabo wa ni. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Owuso ke pyitikpi tuwa kweyi oshuwa bita do geyagye dinyiwo ki iso. Omani wa gyogye kpo oza ni okpa kawobane kani mo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">&lt;Ase ki Izrayila! Ami pini</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">ala shoko ki peshi ko obize dami</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">kishayi awene ododa la lo.<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Adaba keka ko Omoleki pini ala nga la,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">kweyi oyi ko Orefan, eka kinyiwo kala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">aweka ni ala ya ko geyagye dawa ni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">Mani oni nyya kpala gokpagye ni lenu kpo Obabila ni ga meshe.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />&lt;&lt;Awokyikyi kaha gba adaba kolobene ipu ko ododa. Adaba ni Owuso kado Omusa mona gwo ni kweyi ogwo gyogye byoni Owuso kadanu ni. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Ishi gbayayi awosoku ni rogwu kadaba mani bwebe kawada ayawu kpanu ishini ayo kpo Ojoshuwa ni kweyi aga nyo okpagye ni Owuso yase nu sho ni. Adaba mani yebe ni gbishi ko ose Odawuda. <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />Kweyi koni Owuso ya yimu ko Odawuda ni, Odawuda doka mo ona shobita na mole do Owuso ko Oyakubu. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Osolomo pini ke mole danu la.<verse eid="ACT 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />&lt;&lt;Owuso Inekoshu ke yayo ole ni asuse ma ni lo. Byoni inobane kamo,<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />&lt;&lt;Adole kamo Iso pini wo obe hin la,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">kweyi ese webe ko yikpo hin so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Edo kole wonya ni ala ba ma dami?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">Ebenya webe ko minyo hin?<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Ami abiyun pini yawoza mani kpiri la lo?<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />Ostivi kamo: &lt;&lt;Ojiyala ba zakpaha? Oji yotu kala yebe lenu kpo Owuso? Ojiyala tela ko pwoshu ko Owuso? Ala lebya awokyikyi kala: ipu kishi kpiri ala ba tela ko Omaku ko Owuso mama ni! <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Inobane oye yaba ni awokyikyi kala yo ngmo lo ni? Angma ayoleho ko Owuso ni kela ikweyi ko owowa ko Oyole ko Owuso ni. Nabani ala yo ra kweyi ala yo ngmo. <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Ala ni zono ko Owuso ni ayoleho byiwa ni, kweyi ala ke tela ko geyagye danu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ato Ostivi Akyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Ishini onongbo pwoza ni Ostivi kani, otuwa bya kotata kweyi aba shabo ahanu. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Omaku ko Owuso ke yo kpo Ostivi, otiyi miso kweyi omo igyashi ko Owuso, kpo Oyesu ni hagye abore ko Owuso ni. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Ebeni okamo, &lt;&lt;Ala ma, nmiso gwogwa kweyi Oyi ka Asuse hagye abore ko Owuso.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Ebeni onongbo kwotu ko sheha kweyi aya akpaha wa gwu kweyi kpiri wa shabo, <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />abyo gitikpi ko ogya, kweyi akwotu ko takyo. Awolobene yo oshiye wa shobutu ki isongo oye iyenu wo Oshawulu ko yiyi kwo dawa. <verse eid="ACT 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Ni aba to Ostivi akyo ni otinarigwu mo, &lt;&lt;Adole Oyesu, yomaku hin bize.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Ebeni okwagye kweyi okyegba mo, &lt;&lt;Adole Oyesu! Yozalabi wa yi gbuwa!&gt;&gt; Ishini okela mani kweyi ni, ogekwu.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Kweyi Oshawulu dawabokpa koni ayo Ostivi ngmo ni.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 8:1">Oshawulu Da Awogboso Oyesu Egye</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Eneno oni ada awogboso Oyesu owe kotata Ojerusele. Ase kpiri ni kyogwu kpo Oyesu ni kya ge ebebenya agbabo ko Oyahudiya kpo Osamariya, ayikoko ko Oyesu fufuwa pini nyinya lo la. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Ebeni awogeyagye do Owuso wa yo Ostivi nyi, akyegba kotata ikweyi nu.<verse eid="ACT 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Oshawulu ke kwotu ko dawogboso Oyesu egye; oya bwole bwole ya pyawase ni kyogwu kpo Oyesu ni wese, kango kanya, abyuwa go oruduru.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ofilibus Tono Ogya ko Osamariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Ni awase ni kyogwu kpo Oyesu kya ni, age ebebenya, ba tono koshu nu. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Ofilibus gogya nyakwu ko Osamariya, kweyi ya tono ko Omezaya dawa ebe ni. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Ewa kasuse zakpaha neneshi doza ni Ofilibus ya ka ni kpoza kigbashi noya ya ni. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Omaku bibi bose bwikpiye kase nwashika ba sheha, kweyi awase ni ngmonyodu ni kpawo pyepu agye nwashika pyogege. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Ikweyi koni ase shotunehe kotata ogya ni.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Ongo ko Osamariya oye iyenu wo Osimo yebe ni, ozishi nu ya dase igbashi kpa abodiyi nu. Oya ziyinu manu washe nyakwu, <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />kweyi kpiri kase ko ogya, bwikpo wonyonya, ba zakpaha danu. Kweyi ba kamo, &lt;&lt;Owoshu ko Owuso ni agyo mowo Oshu Nyakwu ni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Aba zakpaha danu ikweyi koni ogbeji noya yoza kigbashi kposhu kabodiyi nu ni. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Ni ake pwela ko Ofilibus noya tono ikweyi koshu neshi ko Obula ko Owuso kposhu ko Oyesu Omezaya ni, ayuwo obatisma, kanya kango. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Osimo abiyinu kyogwu kpo Oyesu kweyi ayo obatisma. Oyo kpo Ofilibus kweyi igbashi yokwu ikweyi kawoza kigbashi ni Ofilibus yaya ni.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Ishini ayikoko ko Oyesu ni bo Ojerusele ni pwo mo ase ko Osamariya zela ko Owuso ni, ato Obitrus kpo Oyohana oleho gebe wa. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Ishini afu ni, atinarigwu dawa shini ana nyo Omaku ko Owuso. <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />Koni Omaku ko Owuso sa dashishe wa wa lo; obatisma kin pini ayuwa ipu kiye ka Adole Oyesu la. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Ebeni Obitrus kpo Oyohana yabo wa suwa, kweyi anyo Omaku ko Owuso. <verse eid="ACT 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Osimo ma ni adawo Omaku bwebe kabo ni ayikoko ko Oyesu suwa ni, odo Obitrus kpo Oyohana ikwiri <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />kweyi kamo, &lt;&lt;Ala damoshu mani mamani, shini kpiri kase ni nyyabo so ona nyo Omaku ko Owuso.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Obitrus ke ka danu mo, &lt;&lt;Igbe na to kawo kikwiri wo, oya ma byo oya gege ya reshi ko Owuso kpi ikwiri? <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Ogbabo ipu koko kaha lo, ikweyi koni otuwo woye kponu kpo Owuso lo. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Shagbotu ko ozalabi nogbo otu wo mani, kweyi tinarigwu shini Adole na yi gbo koza ni ogbo ipu kotu wo mani. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Koni nma motu wo nwonwu kpanya kase kweyi ozalabi shotu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Ebeni Osimo kamo, &lt;&lt;Ala tinarigwu da Adole ikweyi hin, shini awoza ni ala ka mani naka gbodagye kpami lo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Ishini ayolobene ki tono kela ka Adole kweyi ni, Obitrus kpo Oyohana kwikye go Ojerusele, ni abowe ni atono ko Oshu Neshi awogya leke nwashika okpagye ko Osamariya.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ofilibus Kpongo ki Itopiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Ebeni oyoleho ka Adole ka do Ofilibus mo, &lt;&lt;Wiyoshu shini oga agbabo ke ekye, zowe ni bwo Ojerusele go Ogaza ni, owe nekye.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Mani oni Ofilibus wiyinushu kweyi nyiso ya ga. Anani ongo ki Itopiya ni ayo bwu ni, anu ni wino byolashiko ko onyose ki Itopiya ni yowe ya ga kole. Obwo Ojerusele no ga geyagye do Owuso ni, <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />kweyi oyikweyi kozo byiyo konya ya gole. Ni ose ya ga ni, oya mokpa kinobane Ishaya. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Omaku ko Owuso ka do Ofilibus mo, &lt;&lt;Gebe koza obyiyo ko onya ni yo ni ga hagye kwo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Ebeni Ofilibus nyinya gebe ni kweyi opwo ya kokpa kinobane Ishaya. Ofilibus doka mo, &lt;&lt;Ogyikweyi koza ni oya ma mani?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Odoka mo, &lt;&lt;Nyya yamoji ya gye, owoni ashe gwikweyi nu dami lo?&gt;&gt; Kweyi omo Ofilibus nawa yagye kpanu ipu koza obyiyo konya nu.<verse eid="ACT 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Ebeni oya ma ipu kokpa ni yoma:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">&lt;&lt;Ole byo otukpo ni abyo ya ga ko ga yo shoko ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">byoni oyi kotukpo ya yokwunu gwu ishini aba woya ni.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">Ogwokwunu kojije lo.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Agbowuru kweyi ayokwokwoshi lo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Ashishe ya gege ya gbigwu kipwoma nu lo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">ikweyi koni oyagye nu kese kwobonu kweyi wa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Ebeni ongo ni ayo bwu mani do Ofilibus oka mo, &lt;&lt;Ka dami, anoho ni inobane mani ya kela ikweyi nu? Oya ka ikweyi kiyinu la kwe ikweyi kashe hoha la?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Ebeni Ofilibus kwotu ko kela; okwotu kpagbabo kokpa noka mani, kweyi otono ko Oshu Neshi ko Oyesu danu.<verse eid="ACT 8:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Ni abipu kiyawu ba ga ni, awa febye ninyo yaba ni, ongo ni ayo bwu mani kamo, &lt;&lt;Inyo yoma. Oji ya wumobi ko yo obatisma?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />Ebeni Ofilibus ka danu mo, &lt;&lt;Owoni okyogwu kpotu wo oye kponu nyya yo.&gt;&gt; Ongo ni ayo bwu oni kamo, &lt;&lt;Nkyogwu mo Oyesu Okristi wo Oyi ko Owuso la.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Kweyi ozoko mana kwoza obyiyo konya na hagye. Ebeni Ofilibus kpongo ni ayo bwu oni sa gipu kinyo, kweyi Ofilibus yo obatisma. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Ishini abose bwipu kinyo ni, Omaku ka Adole yo Ofilibus yi bize. Ongo ni ayo bwu oni mo kelo, anu ke gohobu kpiyawu nu, nwonwu kpotushosha. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Kweyi Ofilibus tiyinu Azotus; ogohobu kpiyawu ya go Okesariya, ya tono ko Oshu Neshi ogya wonyonya.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s">Oshawulu Pya wi Inogboso Oyesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Ishini Oshawulu ya takirikwu ko ngma awogboso Adole ni. Ogebe ko oteyi kawosapa, <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />ga doka kokpa koshu shini ona ga awekpa ipu ko ogya ko Odamasko, owoni opya awogboso owe ka Adole, ona ya yuwa kwu, kwa ango kwa anya, ona yuwa gbo kweyi byuwa kwikye go Ojerusele. <verse eid="ACT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Ni Oshawulu yo pee kpogya ko Odamasko ni, ola yu bwi iso wa shogba to. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Ogbo okpagye kweyi opwo oko ya kela danu mo, &lt;&lt;Oshawulu, Oshawulu, ojiya ni oya dami egye?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Oshawulu kamo, &lt;&lt;Adole owanoho?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:5">Oko mani kadanu mo, &lt;&lt;Ami wo Oyesu ni oya dami egye ni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />&lt;&lt;Nabani ke nyiso shini ogipu ko ogya kweyi aba ka dawo oza ni wotiri do koya ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Awoya kiyawu ko Oshawulu hagye ebe ni kweyi gege ko kela lo, apwoko kela, ake mashishe lo. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Oshawulu nyiso okpagye, ishini ogwiyi ni oke omo ojije lo. Apya abo gogya ko Odamasko. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Ipu kishi oni, oyeno eta ya mebe lo, ya roza lo ke ya gwinyi lo.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Ipu ko Odamasko agbo inogboso oye iyenu wo Ananiya. Adole sayi danu ki yogwu mo, &lt;&lt;Ananiya!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:10">Okyogwu mo, &lt;&lt;Gya, Adole, nyyoma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Adole ka danu mo, &lt;&lt;Go ole ko Oyahuda ni yikweyi ko owe tiriri oni kweyi oga doka kongo ni bwo Otarsus ni iye nu wo Oshawulu. Oya tinarigwu ba, <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />Owuso sayi ko ongo oye, niye nu wa Ananiya danu kweyi osaboneshi shini iyinu na mebe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Ananiya kyogwu mo, &lt;&lt;Adole, ase nwashika kela dami ikweyi ko ongo mani koza labi-labi ni oya kpa awase wo Ojerusele ni. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Kweyi owo Odamasko kpo oshu ni awosapa nyakwu danu kowa kwa awase ni ba yogwu kiye wo ni.<verse eid="ACT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Adole kado Ananiya mo, &lt;&lt;Ga! Ongo mani nsho ko wiyo koko hin la, shini ona yawase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo kpa awose wa kpase ki Izrayila na gyun. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Ami abiyun, nyya shiyanu owe ni oya wotiri danu ko mowe ikweyi kiye hin ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Ebeni Ananiya gipu kole ni Oshawulu yanu ni, kweyi oya abonu so Oshawulu kweyi kamo, &lt;&lt;Oyene hin Oshawulu, Adole Oyesu abiyinu pini omo ikweyi ko owe ishini oya webe mani. Otumoleho mona wa shini oki mebe kweyi Omaku ko Owuso na yo kpawo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Ebebeni oje bya afu kebinyi bose bwiyi ko Oshawulu kweyi oki mebe. Onyiso kweyi ayo obatisma; <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />ishini oroza gbayayi ni opyoshu ki ikpiye.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 9:19">Oshawulu Tono ipu ko Odamasko</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Oshawulu yagye kpa awogboso Oyesu kishi gbayayi Odamasko. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Ebebeni okwotu ko koshu neshi ipu kawekpa mo Oyesu wo Oyi ko Owuso. <verse eid="ACT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Kpiri kawase ni pwela nu, igbashi yuwa kwu kweyi akamo, &lt;&lt;Ongo mani pini wase ni ya ngmase ikweyi kiye ko Oyesu ipu ko ogya ko Ojerusele lalo? Oki webe ni kowa kpuwa byase ni bo oruduru ni ga da awosapa nyakwu la?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Onototu ko Oshawulu ke loshu kweyi ya ka dase ko Oyahuda ni bo Odamasko ni kweyi ya ka dawa mo Oyesu wo Omezaya.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Itikpi ke eno nwashika ni shigbo ni, ase ko Oyahuda ga gbela koyo ngmo, <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />Oshawulu ke kwobonu gyipya wa. Kotu ke eno aba gbeho nu ofunu-oba ko ogya koyo ngmo. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Otu ke eno oye awogboso Oyesu yo Oshawulu yo tipu ko ogwugwu kweyi yo ngma, abyo bwo okpe gese.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oshawulu Go Ojerusele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Ishini Oshawulu wo Ojerusele ni, otakirikwu ko gipu kawogboso Oyesu, kpiri wa ke ba yoshi nu, akyogwu mo owinogboso lo. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Obarnabas ke byo gebe ka ayikoko ko Oyesu. Oka dawa ishini Oshawulu yowe ni oma Adole ni Adole kela danu kweyi otono kiye ko Oyesu Odamasko gboshi lo ni. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Ebeni Oshawulu yagye kpawa kweyi ya gyehe kpotu oye kponu Ojerusele, ya tono kpoko loshu ipu kiye ka Adole. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Oya tono kweyi ya tawashu kpase ko Oyahuda ni ba ko ose ko Girik ni, awa ke ba tikpo ko yo ngmo. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Ishini awokyogwu pwoza mani ni, abyo Oshawulu go Okesariya kweyi abyoshi go Otarsus.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Ebeni kpiri kawase ni bagbabo ko Oyahudiya kpo Ogalili kpo Osamariya ni pyoyagye ko omene. Aloshu ipu ko Omaku ko Owuso, kweyi ewa wa manu, byoni abagye ipu koshi ka Adole ni.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Obitrus Go Olida kpo Ojopa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Ni Obitrus ya gyehe okpagye kpiri ni, ogebe kawase neshi ko Owuso Olida. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Ebeni omo ongo oye iyenu wi Iniyas, ni ngmonyodu kweyi ya gege ko nyiso ogwudu lo kishayi ahata ni. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Obitrus kadanu mo, Iniyas, &lt;&lt;Oyesu Okristi na dawogege. Nyiso sho la aputu wo.&gt;&gt; Ebebeni Iniyas nyiso iso. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Kpiri kase ni bo Olida kpa agye ko Osharon mo kweyi apya gboso Adole.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Ipu ko Ojopa onya oye iyenu wo Otabita, owinogboso Oyesu. (Iyenu okwunu ko ose ko Ogirik wo Odokas). Ozishi nu kpiri ya yoza neshi kweyi ya tawoleha abo. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Ishi oni ogbere kweyi ogekwu. Agwiye kweyi ayokwunu tagye oda ki iso. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Olida lenu kpo Ojopa, ishini awogboso ni bo Ojopa pwo mo Obitrus yo Olida ni, atase epa oleho ga kadanu mo, &lt;&lt;Wa papa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Mani oni Obitrus nyiso kweyi ga kpawa. Ishini ofu ni, abyo goda ki iso ni ayo tagye ni, ebe ni kpiri ka anyokwu hagye beeyi ba kyegba kweyi aba shiyanu oshiye kpo obagidi ni Odokas tu dawa ishini oyiyi ni.<verse eid="ACT 9:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Ebeni Obitrus yuwa kpiri nu sho oda kweyi okwagye ya tinarigwu. Opyiyi gebe ko okwu ko onya mani kweyi okamo, &lt;&lt;Otabita, nyiso.&gt;&gt; Ogwiyi kweyi omo Obitrus, onyiso yagye iso. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Ebeni Obulus webe nu odanu abo kweyi yo nyiso. Ebeni oyawase ni kyogwu ni kpa anyokwu ogwu kweyi yo dawa kpolayi. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Oshu kela mani ge ebebenya agye ko Ojopa, kweyi ase nwashika kyogwu kpa Adole. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Obitrus yagye Ojopa ke eno nwashika ole kino yoko ko okpa iyenu wo Osimo.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s">Obitrus Kpo Okoneliyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Ongo oye yo Okesariya iye nu wo Okoneliyo, owoteyi kikpo kawadakare ko Oroma ni aba yuwogu mi &lt;&lt;Ikpo ki Itali ni&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Ogboshi ko Owuso, kanu kipwoma nu ba geyagye do Owuso. Oya yawoleha ko Oyahuda eshi kweyi ya tinarigwu do Owuso ishi kpiri. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Eno oye abo kogye eta kisheno Owuso gwaniyi, omoyoleho ko Owuso neneshi webe nu wa kamo, &lt;&lt;Okoneliyo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Oyiyi kwoyoleho kposhi kweyi doka mo, &lt;&lt;Olela, Adole?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:4">Oyoleho ko Owuso ka danu mo, &lt;&lt;Otu ko Owuso sha kpawo ikweyi kinarigwu tota wo kpoko ko tasabo noya ya ni, kweyi opwoboba wo. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Nabani, tase oleho go Ojopa ebe kongo oye niye nu wo Osimo Obitrus ni. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />Owogboga ole ko Osimo ino gokpa, ni ole nu yokwunu ki ishu ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Ebeni oyoleho ko Owuso ganu, Okoneliyo yayole nu epa kpadakare oye niya yoko danu kweyi wino ko Owuso ni ogu. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Okojoji kpiri ni gbodagye ni dawa kweyi otuwoleho go Ojopa.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Eno ko omwepa, ni abowe kweyi wa pee kpo Ojopa ni, abo kisheno Obitrus toshi goda kiso ko ga tinarigwu. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Emye ya ngmo kweyi oya yimu ko roza; ake yozarore kweyi wa lo, Owuso gwaniyi. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Omiso gwa kweyi oje bya ayikyi ya sa wa kokpagye bwagbabo ene ni ogbo ni. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Ogbedo kawobize wonyonya ipunu, kpawoza ni ba pyipu agye bya apwa, kpawigbano kpiri. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Ebeni oko kela kpanu mo, &lt;&lt;Obitrus, nyiso; ngmo sho ha.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Obitrus ke kamo, &lt;&lt;Aayi, Adole! Nyya hoza fofu lo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Oko oni ki kela kpanu komwepa mo, &lt;&lt;Ka yojije ni Owuso mo wo sere ni ogu moza fofu lo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Oza mani gbodagye igbeta, kweyi akwikye oza ni giso.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Obitrus byotu kotata kweyi ya kamo oji wase koza ni Owuso gwamiyi ma mani, awase ni Okoneliyo tuwoleho ni kwobonu pyowe kole ko Osimo, kweyi awa hagye ofunu kole. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Azoko iso ba doka mo, &lt;&lt;Ogboga oye yebe ni wine kiye ko Osimo Obitrus?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Obitrus ke tayayo ya takirikwu ko gyikweyi koza ni agwaniyi ma ni, Omaku ko Owuso ka danu mo, &lt;&lt;Pwo! Ango ase eta ba tikpo wo oma. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Nyiso shini osa gokpagye, ka yoshi ko ga kpawa lo, ami pini tuwo oleho la.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Mani oni Obitrus sa ga kadawa mo, &lt;&lt;Ami pini wase ni ala ba tikpo ni la. Oji byala wa?<verse eid="ACT 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Ebeni akyogwu mo, &lt;&lt;Oteyi ka adakare Okoneliyo pini taholeho la, Owase neshi la kweyi okiya yoshi ko Owuso, kpiri ka Ase ko Oyahuda bamo gyiyi. Oyoleho sere ka danu mona yogu wole nu, shini ona pwoza ni ogbo koka ni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Ebeni Obitrus yuwogu gipu kole kweyi yuwa kya gbokyi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Eno ko omwepa, Owiyinushu kweyi ga kpawa; kweyi awogboso Oyesu ashini ni bo Ojopa ni byoshi. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Eno ni gboso ni afo Okesariya, ebe ni Okoneliyo ya gbishi nu ni, kanu kawoya nu kpayinanu no pawa ni. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Obitrus ya gipu ole, Okoneliyo gbayi kpanu, okwagye obutu nu, ya ge yagye danu. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Obitrus ke ka danu mo, &lt;&lt;Nyiso iso, ami abiyun wasuse kin la.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Ni obyela ya ka kpo Okoneliyo ni, ogipu kole ga mewa kasuse ni tukpa ni. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Oka dawa mo, &lt;&lt;Ala abiyikala gye kamo ono ka Ase ko Oyahuda wahobi ko rema kawase ni wase ko Yahuda lo ni, kwako gole wa. Owuso ke shiyami mo naka febi kashishe lo. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Ikweyi koni ishini otoleho mona wani, nwwa otu oye kponu. Nabani nyya doka, ojiya ni oyumogwu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Okoneliyo kamo, &lt;&lt;Ishi ma eneta ni shigbo ni nyya tinarigwu, abo kogyeta kisheno. Ebeni ongo oye wa hagye obutu hin kposhiye yoyu <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />kweyi kamo, &lt;Okoneliyo, Owuso pwi inarigwu wo kweyi rela keshi wo ni oya dawoleha ni. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Tase oleho go Ojopa shini ana ga yongo oye niye nu wo Osimo Obitrus ni ogwu. Owogboga ole ko Osimo ino gokpa niyo okwunu ki ishu ni.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Ozani yani ntoleho ebebeni gebewo ni oma, kweyi oyoza neshi ni owa ni. Anani kpiri kaha bobutu ko Owuso ebe ni, ba gbeyi ko pwoza kpiri ni Owuso ka dawo mo ka daha ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Obitrus Kela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Ebeni Obitrus kwotu ko kela dawa mo, &lt;&lt;Anani nggye mowokwokwoshi, Owuso yimu kashe shashe lo. <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />Oya kyogwu kpase kpiri bwose wonyonya ni gboshi nu kweyi ba yoza ni wo gyogye ni. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Ala gyoleho ni otu gebe kase ki Izrayila ni, ko Oshu Neshi ko otumene bwebe ko Oyesu Okristi, ni wa Adole kananoho ni. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Ala gyoza nyakwu ni gbodagye okpagye ki Izrayila ni, kwotu bwo Ogalili itikpi ko ono totu ko obatisma ni Oyohana tu ni. <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Ala gyela ko Oyesu ko Onazaret kposhu ko Omaku ni Owuso shikweyi ni. Oge ebebenya, ya yoza neshi kweyi ya da awase ni babo ki Ibiri ni ogege, koni Owuso yo kpanu ni.<verse eid="ACT 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />&lt;&lt;Aha wolobene kojoji kpiri noya okpagye ki Izrayila kpo Ojerusele ni. Ebeni ayo ngmo bwebe ko yo poshi. <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />Owuso ke yo nyiso bwikwu eno komweta, kweyi oyase mo, <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />ase kpiri pini mo lalo, awolobene ni Owuso kwobonu shu ni la, aha ni re ki gwa kpanu ishini onyiso ikwu ni. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Oka daha mo ahan tono koshu neshi dase kweyi an yolobene manu pini wase ni Owuso shu wino kepwo kawinolayi kpalekwu ni la. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Kpiri kawobane kela ikweyi nu, mase ni kyogwu kpanu aba yozalabi nu yi gbo bwebe koshu kiye nu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Awase ni Wase ko Oyahuda lo ni Nyo Omaku ko Owuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Obitrus yipu ko kela, Omaku ko Owuso sa ikweyi kase kpiri ni ba pwela nu ni. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Igbashi ya Ase ko Oyahuda ni kyogwu kpo Oyesu ni kwu ikweyi koni Owuso yeshi ko Omaku nu sa ikweyi kawase ni wa Ase ko Oyahuda lo ni, awa ni wa kpo Obitrus bwo Ojopa ni. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />Apwuwa ba kela okwunu kose gogo-gogo, kweyi ba sho Owuso iye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:46">Ebeni, Obitrus kamo, <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />&lt;&lt;Awase mani nyeshi ko Omaku byoni aha nye ni. Ashe ya gege ya wuwobi ko yobatisma kinyo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Ebeni ozoko mana yuwobatisma ipu kiye ko Oyesu Okristi. Ebeni abo Obitrus mona yagye kpawa kishi gbayayi.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s">Obitrus Kyoleho Doda ko Owuso ko Ojerusele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Ayikoko ko Oyesu kpa awokyogwu ni bagye ko Oyahudiya ni kpiri pwo mo awase ni wo Oyahuda lo ni zela ko Owuso. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Ishini Obitrus go Ojerusele ni, ikpo kawogboso Oyesu ni kyogwu kpofu shoshe ni ba kwepwo mo, <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />&lt;&lt;Ogole kawase ni wo Oyahuda lo ashuwofu lo ni kweyi oki roza kpawa!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Obitrus kwotu ko gwikweyi kojoji ni gbodagye ni bwikyikyo mo: <verse eid="ACT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />&lt;&lt;Ni nyyo ogya ko Ojopa ya tinarigwu ni, Owuso gwamiyi. Nmoje byo opa ya sa wokpagye bwi iso kweyi gbagbabo ene sa ya webe hin. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Nyyi iyi kwo kweyi nmawobize kpebe kikyashi, kpa awoza ni ba pyipu agye bya apwa ni, kpa awigbano. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Ebeni npwoko ya kada ami mo, &lt;Obitrus nyiso shini oshoko sho ha!&gt; <verse eid="ACT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Nke kamo, &lt;Adole, nyya gege lo! Oza fofu oyoye go okwunu hin ebyibye walo.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Oko mani ki kela bwi iso mo, &lt;Ka yoza ni Owuso yo woza sere ni ogwu mo woza fofu lo.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Omani gbodagye igbeta, kweyi ebeni apyo kwikye giso.<verse eid="ACT 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />Ebebeni ango eta ni atuwoleho ebe hin bwo Okesariya ni wa hagye ofunu kole ni nyyanu ni. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Omaku ka dami mo na ga kpawa naka ngmishi lo. Awokyogwu ase ihiri bwo Ojopa mani byumoshi go Okeseriya, kweyi aha gipu kole ko Okoneliyos. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Oka daha manu mo oyoleho hagye ole nu kweyi ka danu mo, &lt;Toleho go Ojopa ebe kongo ni iyenu wo Osimo Obitrus ni. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />Oya kela dawo ni aba ngmawo kpole wo ni.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Ishini nkwotu ko kela ni, Omaku ko Owuso sa ikweyi wa byoni osa ikweyi kaha ikyikyo ni. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Ebeni nroza ni Adole kani mo: &lt;Oyohana yo obatisma kpinyo, ala ke aba yala obatisma kpo Omaku ko Owuso.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Owoni Owuso dawase ni wo Oyahuda lo ni eshi byoni odaha ishini akyogwu kpa Adole Oyesu Okristi ni; ami wanoho ko wo Owuso obi koza!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Ishini apwela mani ni, ayo okwunu wa gwu kweyi aba sho Owuso iye, kamo, &lt;&lt;Owuso dawase ni wase ko yahuda lo ni oshu ko shagbotu shini ana gbo olayi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oda ko Owuso ka Antakiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Ashini kawokyogwu ni ayuwa kya kpegye ni gbodagye ishini ayo Ostivi ngmo ni nyinya gebe lenu byagye ko Ofunisiya kpo Osipros kpo Antakiya, aba kela ko Owuso dase ko Oyahuda kin. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Ashishini kawokyogwu ni ke, bwagye ko Osipros kpo Osirin ni ga Antakiya kweyi aki tono kela dase ko Ogirik, aba koshu neshi ka Adole Oyesu dawa. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Oshu ka Adole yo kpawa, kweyi ase nwashika kotata kyogwu kweyi kwikye webe ka Adole.<verse eid="ACT 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Oshu kela mani gakpaha ko oda ko Owuso nibo Ojerusele ni, kweyi ato Obarnabas oleho ga Antakiya. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Ishini Obarnabas fu ni, omabo neshi ni Owuso dase ni, otu nu sha kweyi otuwotugbagba mana bagye ipu kokwokwoshi ka Adole kpotu wa oye kponu. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Obarnabas wase neshi, Omaku ko Owuso yo kpanu kweyi ogbotuse, kweyi abyase nwashika kotata webe ka Adole.<verse eid="ACT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Ebeni Obarnabas tikpo ko Oshawulu go Otarsus. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Ishini omo ni, obyo wa Antakiya. Oshawulu kpo Obarnabas wa gbayi kpase koda ko Owuso kweyi fase nwashika kotata oza, goza kishayi oye. Ipu ka Antakiya pini aya awogboso kikykyo ogwu mo Awogboso Okristi.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Ishi oni, ashini kawobane sho Ojerusele bita ga Antakiya. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Ebeni ashe ipu wa iyenu wa Agabus, Omaku yo kpanu kweyi onyiso kweyi bane mo aba wa ngmemye kotata agye ko Oroma kpiri. Omani gbodagye oyi ko Okladiya. <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Awogboso, kyogwu ma ananoho wa na tikpo koza ko tawa ayene nibo Oyahudiya ni abo gyogye kpo oshunu. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Aya mani kweyi atoleho kpe eshi wa ga danyakwase bwabo ko Obarnabas kpo Oshawulu.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s">Ayo Oyakubu Ngmo, Ayo Obitrus Shetu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Ipu kishi mani Ose Ohiridus kwotu ko da awogboso Oyesu egye. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Oyo Oyakubu oyene ko Oyohana yi ngmo kpe ewakpa. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Ohiridus mani oza ni oya ni shase ko Oyahuda otu ni, oki yo Obitrus yikwu kweyi yo shetu. Omani gbodagye ishi kimya kikyoga ni gbo Oyisi lo ni. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Ni oyo Obitrus kwu ni, oyo toruduru, oyo dikpo ka awadakare ene mana gbeho nu. Ohiridus ya yimu shini ana byo wese shini ase na kwepwo iyi kananoho itikpi kimya ko Sheyi.<verse eid="ACT 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Ayo Obitrus to oruduru, awogboso ke tinarigwu kotata ikweyi nu kotata shini Owuso na tabo.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayo Obitrus Ngma Sho Shetu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Otu ko gbeno ni Ohiridus ya byo wese ko kepwo ni, Obitrus ya gbola otutetehe kawadakare epa. Ayo gbo kpa ashirika epa, kweyi adakare bokwunu koko wa ofunu owe ko oruduru. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Ebebeni oyoleho ka Adole bose danu kweyi ola yu ipu koda. Odo Obitrus abo ashikwu kweyi shiyi mo, &lt;&lt;Nyiso papa!&gt;&gt; Kweyi ashirika she abo nu.<verse eid="ACT 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Ebeni oyoleho ka danu mo, &lt;&lt;Kpo oshiye wo shoko shini okpo okpabawu wo likpo.&gt;&gt; Kweyi Obitrus ya mani. Oyoleho ki kamo &lt;&lt;Kpo obagidi shikpiye shini ogbosun.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Obitrus gboso bose shoruduru, anu ke gye moza ni oyoleho yaya mani ya gbodagye okwokwoshi lalo; oya ma byo owa ana la. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Ashigbo kawadakare kikyikyo kpa akomwepa, awo owofunu kogye ko gipu kogya. Ofunu gwa dawa abiyinu kweyi abwanu gese. Abose yawu go owe oye ebebeni oyoleho sho Obitrus bita.<verse eid="ACT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Ebeni Obitrus kwikye wiyinu kweyi okamo &lt;&lt;Nabani ngye mo Adole so oyoleho nu abo kowa yun ngma shabo ko Ohiridus kpo oza ni ase ko Oyahuda yotuse moya gbodagye ni.<verse eid="ACT 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Ishini Obitrus gye mani ni, ogole ko Omeremu ene ko Oyohana ni aba yogwu mo Omarkus ni, ase lewa gbayi ba tinarigwu. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Ebeni Obitrus gwabo ofunu kole, oyole oye nonya iyenu wo Oroda wa shoko mese. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Ishini opwoko wako Obitrus ni otu nu sha kotata kweyi onyinya kwikye gipu kole gbo gwofunu kelo, kweyi ga kamo Obitrus hagye ese oma. <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Aka danu mo, &lt;&lt;Oya nyoza!&gt;&gt; Ohokoko nu mo owokwokwoshi. Aka danu mo, &lt;&lt;Oya wo oyoleho nu la.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Obitrus ke tayayo ya gwabo ofunu, awa gwofunu kweyi amo, kweyi igbashi yuwa kwu. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Anu ke yuwabo mo ana sha kweyi okadawa oza ni Adole ya ome ni oyo ngma shoruduru ni. Oka dawa mo, &lt;&lt;Ala kado Oyakubu kpa ayene shishini oza mani,&gt;&gt; ebeni oshuwa bita gebye hoha.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Ishini ebenya ni, oshi yawadakare kwu kweyi aba tawashu kpi iyiwa mo, oji gbodagye kpo Obitrus? <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Ohiridus zoko dawa mo ana tikpo nu, ake mo lo. Mani oni oyuwa dawo gbeho oka kweyi ozoko mana yuwa ngmo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 12:19">Ebeni Ohiridus shokpagye ko Oyahudiya bita go Okesariya ga yagye ebeni kishi gbayayi.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikwu ko Ohiridus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Otu ko Ohiridus bya kpase ko Otaya kpo Osidon, mani oni akpikweyi gbayi kweyi gebe komo. Ikyikyo agebe ko Obilatus niwo oteyi kole ko ose ni, ga kwikpo nu mona tuwabo. Ebeni agebe ko Ohiridus ga shagye koyagye komene, ikweyi koni okpagye wa ba pyo ozarore wa bwo okpagye ko ose la.<verse eid="ACT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Eno ni atu ni, Ohiridus shoshiye ko ose nu, oyagye ebe nu, kweyi okela dawase mani. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Asheha kamo, &lt;&lt;Omani woko keka pini kela la, waka asuse lalo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Ebebeni oyoleho ka Adole wayo Ohiridus gwotonu ikweyi koni odo Owuso abokpa lo ni. Iyu ho kweyi ogekwu.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Ela ko Owuso ke yagye gohobu ebebenya.<verse eid="ACT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Ishini Obarnabas kpo Oshawulu yoko wa kweyi ni akwikye bwo Ojerusele wa kpo Oyohana ni aba yogwu mo Omarkus ni.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s">Asho Obarnabas kpo Oshawulu Kweyi Tuwoleho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Ipu kawogboso Oyesu ogya ka Antakiya agba awobane kpawofoza, Obarnabas kpo Osimo (ni aba yogwu mo Ase Nobi ni), kpo Olusiyos ko Osirin kpo Omanayi ni abyo ipu kole ko ogbolamaga Ohiridus ni, kpo Oshawulu. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Ni aba geyagye da Adole kweyi ba kwokwunu ni, Omaku ko Owuso kamo, &lt;&lt;Ala sho Obarnabas kpo Oshawulu ko yoko ni nyyuwogwu koya ni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Mani oni akwokwunu kweyi tinarigwu kweyi ni, ayabo wa suwa aka dawa mo ana ga.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ipu ko Ogya ko Osipros</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Omaku ko Owuso to Obarnabas kpo Oshawulu oleho go Osalukiya, bwebe ni asheyi gega kishu ko Osipros. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Ishini afo ogya ko Osalamis ni, atono kela ko Owuso ipu kekpa ka Ase ko Oyahuda. Oyohana ni aba yogwu mo Omarkus ni yawu kpa awa kweyi ya tuwabo kpo oko.<verse eid="ACT 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Ishini agyehe to okpagye ni inyo shoga to ni kpiri awa fo Opafos. Ebeni amongo oye ni wase ko Oyahuda ni ya yoza kigbashi kweyi ya ziyinu winobane, iyenu wo Obar-Oyesu. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />Owo oyole ko ogbolamaga Osagyiyos Obulus. Ogbolamaga mani wino gyoza neneshi, oziyi, oki wogbolamaga kokpagye ni inyo shogba to ni. Otoleho gebe ko Obarnabas kpo Oshawulu mo ana wa ikweyi koni oya yimu ko pwela ko Owuso. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Elima ino yabodiyi, (iyenu okwunu ko ose ko Girik oma), oya yimu ko yo ogbolamaga otu gbo shini onaka kyogwu kpo Oyesu lo. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Ebeni Oshawulu ni aba yogwu mo Obulus ni, Omaku ko Owuso yo kpanu kweyi oziyi me Elima, <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />kweyi kadanu mo, &lt;&lt;Owoyi ki Ibiri kweyi oki wo omonyekwotu koza kpiri ni woneshi ni! Otuwo nwonwu kpedo kozabibi wonyonya kpegya gyogya. Ishi kpiri oya yokwokwoshi ka Adole pya wokame! <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Anani abo ka Adole ya sa ikweyi wo, oya wofiyi, oya moyoyu ke eno lo kishi gbayayi.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:11">Ebebeni Elima mebwu kpebe dibu yiyi gwu, oya gyehe ya mabo ya tikpo kase ni ya pyabo ni. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Ishini ogbolamaga moza ni gbodagye ni, okyogwu, ikweyi koni igbashi yokwu ikweyi kozafofu ka Adole.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ipu Ka Antakiya Agye ko Opisidiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Obulus kpawoya kiyawu nu sho Opafos bita kweyi sheyi go Opega, ipu kagye ko Opamfiliya, ebeni Oyohana ni aba yogwu mo Omarkus ni shuwa bita kweyi kwikye go Ojerusele.<verse eid="ACT 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Awa ke gohobu bwo Opega go Opisidiya agye ka Antakiya. Eno kominyo agekpa ga bagye. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Ishini ako Okpa ko Ono ko Omusa kpa awenena kawobane kweyi ni, awoteyi kekpa toleho ebewa mo, &lt;&lt;Ayene, owoni ala gboshu ko tase otugbagba ala ka dawa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Ebeni Obulus nyiso iso kweyi yuwabo kweyi kwotu ko kela kamo, &lt;&lt;Ase ki Izrayila kpa awase ni wo Oyahuda lo ni ba geyagye do Owuso ni, ala pwo! <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Owuso kase ki Izrayila shawada kaha, ozuwa iso ishini awogboga okpagye ki Ijip ni, kpo oshu kabo nu okpuwogwu bose shokpagye ni. <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />Ozotu kpawa kishayi awene ipu ipu kinweshi. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Oyawose ahapa ni bagye ko Okana ni kya kweyi oyawase nu rogwu kokpagye wa. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Kpiri kawoza mani zishi goza kishayi ogbogbo ene saweho.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:20">Itikpi koza mani, Owuso dawa awokepwo gbishini ofishi kinobane Osamuwe. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Ebeni adoka kose, kweyi Owuso dawo Oshawulu oyi ko Okish bwipwoma ko Obenjami kweyi owose wa kishayi awene. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Ni Owuso yo Oshawulu ngma ni, osho Odawuda wo ose wa. Ozani Owuso ka ikweyi nu ni oma, &lt;Odawuda oyi ko Ojesi wase ni otu hin ya yimu ni, oya yojoji kpiri ni nyya yimu mona yani.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />Bwi ipwoma ko Odawuda Owuso dase ki Izrayila inongmese Oyesu byoni oshokoyi ni. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Ome Oyesu na kwotu koko nu, Oyohana tono ko shagbotu dase nwashika ki Izrayila kweyi yuwo obatisma. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Ni oko ko Oyohana ya wo okweyi ni, okamo, &lt;Anoho ni ala bama byun we? Ami wase ni ala ba gbeyi nu lalo. Ala pwo! Oya wa itikpi hin, ni ngye ko yokpabawu kikpo nu yiyi lo ni.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />Ala ayene hin ki Izrayila, ayi kipwoma ki Ibirayi, kpawase kpiri ni wo Oyahuda lo ni bebe mani ko geyagye do Owuso ni, aha pini Owuso toleho koshu ngmase mani daha la. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Ikweyi koni ase ko Ojerusele kpa awose wa gye mo owino ngmese lo, ake gyikweyi kela kawobane ni aba ma Eno ko Minyo wonyonya ni lo. Ake yela kawinobane gya na yo Oyesu kwu yongmo ni. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Koni agbo ojije ko kwepwo ko yo ngmo lo ni, ayo Obilatus zoko dawa kweyi ayo ngmo. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Ishini ayoza kpiri ni okpa ko Owuso ka ikweyi nu ni, awa yo sa bwoshi kweyi ayo nyi. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Owuso ke yo nyiso bwikwu, <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />eno nwashika osayi nu dawase niba yawu kpanu bwo Ogalili go Ojerusele. Awani wo olobene nu nabani ebe kase ki Izrayila. <verse eid="ACT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />Aha ba koshu neshi dala. Okoyi ni Owuso shawokyikyi kaha ni <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />oyiya daha ayiwa bwebe ko ngo Oyesu bwikwu. Byoni ayitota ipu kokpa ko Ozabura ko omwepa mo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">&lt;&lt;&lt;Awo wo Oyi hin la,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:33">ikyeni nwa Ada wo.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Omani woza ni Owuso ka ikweyi ko ngo Oyesu bwikwu, shini onaka gekwu kelo. Ayita ipu kawela mani mo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">&lt;&lt;&lt;Nyya sala abo neshi ko Owuso byoni nmo nyya so Odawuda ni.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Byoni oki ka ipu kokpa ko Ozabura oye ni mo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:35">&lt;&lt;&lt;Oya shoyole wo kokwokwoshi bita na gekwu kweyi wowa lo.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />&lt;&lt;Odawuda yoko ko Owuso oki geyagye danu ishi nu kweyi ogekwu, ayo nyi kpa awokyikyi nu, kweyi owowa. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Ase ni Owuso yo nyiso ikwu ni ke wowa lo.<verse eid="ACT 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />Mani oni ayene hin, nyya yimu shini alagye mo bwebe ko Oyesu pini akoshu koyo ozalabi yina dala bwebe ko ono ko Omusa: <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />Alagye mo kpiri kase ni kyogwu kpo Oyesu, ayo ngma sho ozalabi wo ni ono ko Omusa gege yo ngma lo ni. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Ni olemani oni ala gbera shini awoza ni awobane kani na gbodagye kpa ala lo.<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />Ala sha, alawo kela bibi ikweyi koza ni Owuso kani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">nyya yoza kigbashi na kwala shini ala gekwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">nyya yoje ishi mani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">nala ba akyogwu kpanu lo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">owoni ashe kadala!&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Obulus kpo Obarnabas ba shekpa bita, ase wa pawa mo ana wa kyela mani kadawa eno kominyo ni yawa ni.<verse eid="ACT 13:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Ishini angmeyi ko gbayi wa ekpa ni, Ase ko Oyahuda kpawase ni wo yahuda lo ni nwashika gboso Obulus kpo Obarnabas ni pya ba gboso Oyahuda. Ayikoko kela dawa, kyi tuwotugbagba mana yawu ipu ko oneshi ko Owuso.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Ni eno kominyo wani, kpiri kase ko ogya wa gbayi ba pwela ka Adole. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Ishini Ase ko Oyahuda mewa kasuse ni, ayanya kotata kweyi ba kela bibi ikweyi Obulus kweyi kyi sesa.<verse eid="ACT 13:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Ebeni Obulus kpo Obarnabas ke kyogwu gboshi lo mo, &lt;&lt;Ashu ko kela ko Owuso dala ikyikyo. Ala ta kala kweyi ala miyi kala mo ala shu ko pyo olayi ko gbogbo-gbogbo lo, aha pya kaha gebe kawase ni wo Oyahuda lo ni. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Ono ni Adole daha ni yoma:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">&lt;&lt;&lt;Nyyo woyoyu dawase ni wo Oyahuda lo ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:47">shini bwebe wo Owuso na ngmase kese kpiri.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Ishini awaseni wo Oyahuda lo ni pwela mani, otuwa sha kweyi asha Adole iye. Awase ni ashuwa ko pyo olayi ko gbogbo-gbogbo ni kyogwu.<verse eid="ACT 13:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Ela ka Adole ge ebebenya agbabo ni. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Ase ko Oyahuda ke tela ka awolodu kogya ni, kpa awolodu ka anya ni wo Oyahuda lo ba geyagye do Owuso ni. Akwotu kodo Obulus kpo Obarnabas egye kweyi ayuwa nu shokpagye wa. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Ayole gwomutu kikpo wa shini na wolobene ikweyi wa kweyi agawa gogya ki Ikoniya. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Awogboso Adole niba Antakiya otuwa shehe nwu kpo Omaku ko Owuso.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s">Ogya ki Ikoniya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Ogbodagye mamani ogya ki Ikoniya: Obulus kpo Obarnabas gekpa ga kela ni ya Ase ko Oyahuda nwashika kpawase ni wo Oyahuda lo ni nwashika kyogwu. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Ase ko Oyahuda ni ke tela ko kyogwu ni kpawase ni wo Oyahuda lo ni okwunu kweyi ayotu wa bya kpawase ni kyogwu ni. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Mani oni, Obulus kpo Obarnabas gbeji ebe ni ba kela ka Adole gboshi yoya lo, Adole shawa moleho keshi nu naba tono wokwokwoshi bwebe koshu ko yoza kigbashi ni odawa ni. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Okunu kase ko ogya ko: ikpo oye ba gboso Ase ko Oyahuda, ikpo oye ba gboso ayikoko ko Oyesu. <verse eid="ACT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Mani oni awase ni wo Oyahuda lo ni kpa Ase ko Oyahuda kpa anyakwase wa ga gbela kowa dayikoko ko Oyesu mani owe, kweyi ana tuwakyo. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Ni ayikoko ko Oyesu mani pwo ni, anyinya gawogya nyakwu ko Olikoniya, Olistra kpo Odabi kpawo okpagye ni kuwa ni, <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />ebe ni agohobu ko ko Oshu Neshi.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ipu Olistra kpo Odabi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Ipu ko ogya ko Olistra ongo oye amo shikini bwipu kinanu kweyi ya gege ko yawu lo. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Oyakpaha tagye ya pwoza ni Obulus ya ka ni. Obulus motuse nu gye ko danogege, mani oni oyiyi kwo tiriri <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />kweyi ka danu kpoko nyakwu mo, &lt;&lt;Nyiso sho hagye ikpo wo!&gt;&gt; Ebeni ongo oni shibi hagye iso kweyi kwotu ko yawu ebebeni.<verse eid="ACT 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Ishini ewa kasuse moza ni Obulus yani, asheha okwunu ko ose ko Olikoniya mo, &lt;&lt;Awowuso lema byasuse kweyi sa webe ka!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Ebeni ato Obarnabas iye mo Oziyus, Obulus atiye mo Ohames ikweyi koni anu wose kela koka ni. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Osapa keka ni aba yogwu mo Oziyus ni ole nu yese ko ogya, obyena kposhefu wofunu ko gya, koni anu kpewa ba yimu ko peka dayikoko.<verse eid="ACT 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Ishini Obarnabas kpo Obulus ke pwoza ni aba yimu ko ya ni, ayoshiye wa sha kweyi nyinya gipu kewa, ba ngmegba mo, <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />&lt;&lt;Ojiyala baya mani? Aha wasuse byala la! Aha webe ni kowa tono ko Oshu Neshi la, shini ala shawoza kese mani bita, shala webe ko Owuso ni yi iso, kpo okpagye, kpi ishu kpa awoza kpiri ni bipu wa ni. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Nekye-nekye, oshase bita ba yoza ni shuwotu ni. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Kwikyikyeni oke oshiyase olobene manu yaba bwebe kawoza neshi noya ni: anu dalinyo bwi iso kpi izire ipu kishi wa; odala ozarore kweyi yotu kala sha.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Awayikoko ko Oyesu kela mani dawa, kwikyikyeni oluwono ko wasobi ko peka dawa.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Ebeni Ase ko Oyahuda ashini bwa Antakiya ni yo Opisidiya kpi Ikoniya, wa gyuwegya kweyi akyogwu kpela wa. Ato Obulus akyo kweyi pyo gese ko ogya, ama byo ogekwu la. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Ishini awogboso Oyesu ke wa gbayikweyi nu ni, onyiso kweyi kwikye gipu ko ogya. Gbebe nya anu kpo Obarnabas go Odabi.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Obulus kpo Obarnabas Kwikye ga Antakiya ko Osiriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Obulus kpo Obarnabas tono ko Oshu Neshi ipu ko ogya ko Odabi kweyi apyawogboso nwashika. Ebeni akwikye go Olistra kpi Ikoniya, kpa Antakiya okpagye ko Opisidiya. <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />Ada ayikoko ko Oyesu oshu kweyi tuwotugbagba mo, ana hagye loshu ipu kotuse. Afuwa mo, &lt;&lt;Owotiri shini ahan mowe nwashika ome shan go Obula ko Owuso.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Obulus kpo Obarnabas shanyakwase dawo oda ko Owuso kpiri, bwebe kinarigwu kpo okwunu kwokwu ayuwa nabo da Adole Owuso ni ayotu wa kpiri so ni.<verse eid="ACT 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Ishini agyehe okpagye ko Opisidiya akwikye go Opamfiliya. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Ebeni atono ko Oshu Neshi dase ipu ko ogya ko Opega kweyi aga Ataliya,<verse eid="ACT 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />bwebe ni agipu kowu kinyo kweyi kwikye ga Antakiya, ebe ni ayuwa nabo doneshi ko Owuso ikweyi koko ni aya kweyi ni.<verse eid="ACT 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Ishini afa Antakiya ni, akpa awogboso gbayi kweyi akoza ni Owuso ya kpawa ni dawa, kpowe ni ogwa dawase ni wo Oyahuda lo kweyi yuwa kyogwu ni. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Kweyi abagye gbeji kpawase ni kyogwu ni.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s">Ogbayi ko Onongbo Ojerusele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Awashe bwogya ko Oyahudiya ga Antakiya kweyi akwotu ko fawo gboso oza mo, &lt;&lt;Owoni ashala ofu byoni ono ko Omusa ka ni lalo Owuso ya ngmala lo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Elamani yo Obulus kpo Obarnabas tawashu kotata kpawa. Ebeni asho Obulus kpo Obarnabas kpa ashini ipu kawase ni kyogwu mana go Ojerusele ebe kayikoko ko Oyesu kpanyakwase ikweyi kela mani. <verse eid="ACT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Awogeyagye do Owuso gwagye tuwotu, kweyi abwagye ko Ofunisiya kpo Osamariya, aka dawa ma awaseni wo Oyahuda lo ni kyogwu kpo Owuso. Oshu mani yotu kawase ni kyogwu nwashika sha kotata. <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Ishini ake fo Ojerusele ni, awogeyagye do Owuso kayikoko ko Oyesu kpanyakwase, akojoji ni Owuso yoko kpawa yani ashotunehe. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Ebeni ke awase ni kyogwu ni bikpo ka Awofarisi ni nyiso kweyi kamo, &lt;&lt;Owotiri shini awase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni ana shuwofu shini ana ki yuwa nagye mo owotiri shini ana geyagye dono ko Omusa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Awayikoko kpa anyakwase gbayikweyi kela mani. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Na kela nwashika ni, Obitrus takpa nyiso kweyi kadawa mo, &lt;&lt;Ayene hin, alagye nekye-nekye mo Owuso shun ipu kala, shini bwebe hin awase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni na pwo Oshu Neshi ko Owuso ana yotuso. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Owuso ni gyotu kananoho ni, sayi dase manu shawase ni wo Oyahuda lo kweyi dawo Omaku ko Owuso byoni odaha ni. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Oyaha kpawa gogo lo; oyozalabi wa yigbuwa ikweyi koni akyogwu ni. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Ni olemani oni ojiyala ba yimu ko mo Owuso ma, kweyi ala ba gbiyo lenu sawogboso naha kwe awokyikyi kaha bagege kobi lo ni? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Aayi! Owoni aha gbotuse angmaha bwebe koneshi ka Adole Oyesu byoni angmawa ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Kpiri kikpo sha, kweyi ba pwela ni Obarnabas kpo Obulus baka ikweyi kawoza ki igbashi ni Owuso yoko kpawa ipu kase ni wo Oyahuda lo ni. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Ishini akela kweyi ni, Oyakubu takpa nyiso kamo, &lt;&lt;Ayene hin, ala pwun! <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Ikyikyo Osimo kadaha owe ni Owuso gebe kase ni wo Oyahuda lo ni, kweyi shase ipu wa ko wase nu. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Ela kawobane kyogwu kpo mani byo ni okpa ko Owuso ka mo:<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />Adole kamo, &lt;Itikpi komani nyya kwikye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">kweyi nyya wa kya adaba ko Odawuda ama.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">Nyya kyoza ni ayi kye ni ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">kweyi nyya wa kyanu ya neshi.<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />Mani oni kpiri kase ba tikpo hin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17">kweyi kpiri kase ni wo Oyahuda lo ni nyyuwogwu bawa akan.<verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />Mani oni Adole ni yase gyoza mani gbeji gawa ni pini kala.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />Oyakubu ki kamo, &lt;&lt;Omoma kotu hin, ela mani naka byawase ni wo Oyahuda lo ni pya webe ko Owuso ni otu lo. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />Oya shoshi ahan tenena dawa mo anaka roza keka lo, kpeba boba, anaka hoyi kwebe ni ashoko lo ni lo. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Nekye-nekye ase ba ko ono ko Omusa ipu kekpa eno kominyo kpiri aba fuwela nu ogya kpiri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Atokpa ga Dawo Gbotuse ni wo Oyahuda lo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Ebeni ayikoko ko Oyesu kpa anyakwase kpa awase ni ba gbo so Oyesu kpiri kyogwu kweyi ashase epa ipu wa kweyi tuwoleho ga Antakiya kpo Obulus kpo Obarnabas. Ashase epa ipu wa ni awogboso Oyesu ba muwa gyiyi ni, Oyahuda ni aki ba yogwu mo Obarsabas ni kpo Osila. <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />Atuwoleho kpo okpa mo, Bwebe kayene kala ayikoko ko Oyesu kpanyakwase, gebe kawase ni wo Oyahuda lo ni zo Owuso agye ka Antakiya kpo Osiriya kpo Okilikiya, aba tala ogbogba. <verse eid="ACT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Aha pwo mo ashini kase ipu kaha bose yaha gyelo baga ngala otu iso kpedo koza ni aba ka ni. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Kweyi kpiri ka aha kyogwu kweyi asha ayoleho tuwoleho ebe kala. Kpa ayene ka aha moshi Obarnabas kpo Obulus. <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />Ango mani zolayi wa ipu koko ka Adole Oyesu Okristi. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Mani oni, aha kyogwu kweyi to Oyahuda kpo Osila oleho shini ana kadala oza ni aha tani. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Aha kpo Omaku ko Owuso kyogwu shini ahan ka gbiyo lenu ni shawoni sala lo itikpi ko ono mani. <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />Alaka roza ni ayi deka nilo, alaka hoyi kpebe ni ashoko lo ni kpeba boba. Owoni ala bwose shawoza mani, ala yoza neshi.<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Ayoleho ni atuwoleho ni nyiso ga Antakiya, ebe ni aga kpawogboso Owuso tukpa kweyi akyoleho dawa. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Ni amokpa ni, oshu oni tuwotugbagba kweyi otuwa sha. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Oyahuda kpo Osila wa awinobane, azishi kela nwashika kweyi odawoshu kpotugbagba. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Ishini abagye kpawa kishi gbayayi ni, aka dawa mo ana gebe kawase ni tuwoleho ni kpotu mene ipu ko Okristi. <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />Osila ke mamo shoshi ko yebe ni kpawa ome. <verse eid="ACT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Obulus kpo Obarnabas bagye Antakiya kishi gbayayi, ebe ni awa kpashini kase fase oza kweyi tono kela ka Adole.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Obulus kpo Obarnabas Kabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Ipu kishi oye, Obulus kado Obarnabas mo, &lt;&lt;Ahan gawogya ka ayene ka aha ebe ni aha tono kela ka Adole dawa ni, shini ahan gyuwama. <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Obarnabas yimu shini Oyohana ni aba yogwu mo Omarkus naga kpawa, <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />Obulus kema byo oshoshi koga kpanu lo, ikweyi koni oshuwa bita Opamfiliya ni, otela koyoko kpawa gigbeji koko wa. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Kweyi awashu loshu nyiso otutehe wa kweyi akabo. Ebeni Obarnabas zo Omarkus kweyi asheyi ki ishu go Osipros. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Obulus ke sho Osila kweyi aga wa, ayene yuwa nabo deshi ka Adole. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Ago okpagye ko Osiriya kpo Okilikiya kweyi ba tawogboso Oyesu otugbagba.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s">Otimoti Gboso Obulus kpo Osila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Obulus go Odabi kpo Olistra, inogboso Oyesu oye yebeni, iyenu wo Otimoti, inanu ni wase ko Oyahuda ni winogboso Okristi mamani, adanu ke wo Ogirik. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Ayene kpiri nibo Olistra kpi Ikoniya ni ba kela neshi ikweyi ko Otimoti. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Ikweyi koni Obulus ya yimu ko yo Otimoti na ga kpanu ni, oshopu. Oya mani ela ka Ase ko Oyahuda ni bagbabo oni gye mada ko Otimoti wo Ogirik la. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Ni aba bwogya bwogya ni, aka dase ono ni ayikoko ko Oyesu kpanyakwase nibo Ojerusele kwu dase kogboso ni, kweyi aka dawa mana ko ono oni. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Mani oni awoda ko Owuso pyoshu ipu kotuse kweyi ase nwashika ba kyogwu kurutu.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Osayi ko Obulus Otrowas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Aga agbabo ko okpagye ko Ofrijiya kpo Ogalatiya, ikweyi koni Omaku ko Owuso wuwobi ko tono kela agbabo ka Asiya ni. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Ishini awe eji kokpagye ko Omisiya ni, atakirikwu ko ga agbabo Obitiniya, Omaku ko Oyesu ke shuwa bita lo. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Mani oni abwa agbabo ko Omisiya kweyi go Otrowas. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Otu oni iyi ko Obulus iyi omongo ko Omasedoniya oye hagye kweyi ya bo mo, &lt;&lt;Wokpagye ko Omakidoniya wa tahabo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Ni Obulus moza mani, aha wiyikaha shu ko go Omasedoniya, ikweyi koni aha kyogwu mo Owuso yahogu ko ga tono kela nu ogya ni.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Olidiya Zo Oyesu Ofilipi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Aha gbowu bwo Otrowas ga sheyi ki ishu go Osamotrasi, gbebenya ago Oniyapolis. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Bwe ebeni abwokpagye go Ofilipi, ogya nyakwu kikyikyo kagbabo ko Omasedoniya, ogya ni ase ko Oroma nwashika anu ni. Kweyi abagye ebeni ke eno nwashika.<verse eid="ACT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Eno Kominyo, abose ofunu-oba gokwunu ki ishu, ebeni aha totuse mo aba pyebe ni ase ko Oyahuda ba gbayi ko tinarigwu ni. Ebeni abagye okpagye kweyi akwotu ko kela danya ni gbayi ebeni. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Onya oye iyenu wo Olidiya bwogya ko Otiyatera, oya tora ka akyi ni lebyo nowa ni, owonya ni ya geyagye do Owuso ni. Adole gwanotu ko zakpaha doza ni Obulus ya ka ni. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Ni ayobatisma, anu kpase kole nu ni, opaha kamo, &lt;&lt;Ala wa bagye ole hin, owoni ala kyogwu mo nwwino gbosa Adole kokwokwoshi.&gt;&gt; Ohokoko nu gbishini aha ga.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Obulus kpo Osila Bo oruduru Ofilipi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Eno oye ishini aba gebe ko tinarigwu ni, agbayi kpi isonya oye ni wo oshe ni, ogbomaku bibi ni yo ya koza ni yawa gbodagye ohobu ni. Oya byikwiri nwashika wa dawadole nu bwebe koza ni oya ka dase ni. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Oyinonya mani gbosaha kpo Obulus kweyi ya ngmegba mo, &lt;&lt;Ango mani wayole ko Owuso Ine koshu kpiri la! Aba ka dala owe ni ya ngmala ni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Oya mani ke eno nwashika, gbishini otu ko Obulus bya, opyiyi kweyi kado omaku oni mo, &lt;&lt;Ipu kiye ko Oyesu Okristi nyya kado mo bose sho!&gt;&gt; Ebebeni omaku oni bose sho.<verse eid="ACT 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Ishini awadole ki isonya ni wo oshe mani ma mowe ko pyikwiri wa yaba kelo ni, ashabo byo Obulus kpo Osila kweyi pyuwa gopu ebe kawoteyi. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Abyuwa gobutu ka awigabo ko Oroma kweyi kamo, &lt;&lt;Ango mani wase ko Oyahuda la, aba tela ogya kaha. <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />Aba foza ni wodu kaha lo ni; aha wase ko Oroma la, aba kyogwu kpodu mani ko yoko kpanu lo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Ewa kase kpiri nyiso kpafo kweyi kpabo pwayikweyi ko Obulus kpo Osila.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 16:22">Ebeni awo kepwo oni yo Obulus kpo Osila oshiye sha kweyi yase yuwaboshi. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Itikpi kize ni agwuwa kotata ni, akpuwa shoruduru, kweyi aka dine ko gbeho ko oruduru mona yuwa gwu neneshi. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Ni azoko mani danu ni, okpuwa shoda kipu kweyi yuwikpo gbo boshi ni senu kpitiri ni.<verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Abo kotutehe kotu, Obulus kpo Osila ba tinarigwu kweyi ba wigye sho Owuso, kweyi ashini kase ni bo oruduru ni ba pwuwa. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Ebebeni okpagye ja kotata kweyi otu ko oruduru ja. Ipu kishi oye kponu awofunu ko oruduru kpiri gwa, kweyi ashirika nayi tananoho wa ni yi. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Inogbeho ko oruduru shiyi ola, ni omofunu kole ko oruduru kpiri gwogwa ni, oya mamo kwe awase ni bo oruduru ni nyinya wa la, ongmewakpa ko yiyinu ngmo. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Obulus ke ngmegba mo, &lt;&lt;Ka yiyo ofo lo! Kpiri kaha bagye ma!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Ebeni inogbeho ko oruduru mana byikwomu wa, Kweyi onyinya gipu ga gbo obutu ko Obulus kpo Osila ya wode kikpiye. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Ebeni obyuwa gese kweyi duwoka mo, &lt;&lt;Awadole, oji ni nyya ya shini ana ngmami?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Aka danu mo, &lt;&lt;Kyogwu kpa Adole Oyesu, aba ngmawo kawo kase kole wo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Ebeni atono kela ka Adole danu kpa ashini kase kole nu kpiri. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Ototu oni obyuwa ga yuwipi na kweyi ebebeni ayobatisma, anu kpase kole nu kpiri. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Ebeni obyo Obulus kpo Osila gole nu ga dawoza re. Anu kpase kole nu shotunehe ikweyi koni anani akyogwu kpo Owuso ni.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Ishini ebenya ni, awino kepwo ko Oroma tawogbogbo-gbipu oleho mo, &lt;&lt;Ala shango ni bita na ga wa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Mani oni Inogbeho ko oruduru kado Obulus mo, &lt;&lt;Awino kepwo toleho wa mo na shawo kpo Osila bita. Nabani ala ga kala. Ala ga kpomene.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 16:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Obulus ke ka dawogbogbo-gbipu mo, &lt;&lt;Akwaha kpepwo labi oyoye lo, kwikyikyeni ayaha aboshi iyi kananoho, aha ke wase ko Oroma la! Akpaha shoruduru. Anani aba yimu ko yaha ngma kyokyokyo? Aayi! Awigabo ko Oroma na wa abiyiwa wa ngmaha gese.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 16:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Awogbogbo-gbipu ga ka dawo kepwo; kweyi ishini apwo mo Obulus kpo Osila wase ko Oroma ni, oshi yuwa kwu. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Mani oni ga shagye dawa; ebeni abyuwoshi bose shoruduru, kweyi abuwa mana shogya bita. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Ishini Obulus kpo Osila bose shoruduru ni, agole ko Olidiya. Aga tawo ogboso ebeni, atuwotugbagba, kweyi aga wa.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s">Ipu ko Otasalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Ishini Obulus kpo Osila shigbo bwagye ka Amfipolis kpa Apoloniya ni, ago Otasalonika ebe ni ekpa ko Oyahuda yanu ni. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Byoni owodu nu ni, Obulus ya gipu kekpa ebewa kobize eta ya kela kpawa bwipu kokpa ko Owuso. <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />Oya gwikweyi kela bwo Okpa dawa, kweyi ya shawa mo owotiri shini Omezaya na mowe kweyi gekwu, kweyi nyiso bwi ikwu. Obulus ki ka dawa mo, &lt;&lt;Oyesu ni nyya kela nu dala mani, pini wo Omezaya la.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Ashini wa kyogwu kpo oza ni okani kweyi agboso Obulus kpo Osila, mamani anya kpawo Ogirik ni gboshi ko Owuso ni nwashika kpa kanya ni aba muwa gyiyi ni.<verse eid="ACT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Ase ko Oyahuda ke yanya koni amase nwashika gboso Obulus kpo Osila ni, akpayi kowu bwopu kweyi awa shosha nyiso. Anyinya gole ko Ojason baga tikpo ko Obulus kpo Osila shini ana byuwa wese ebe kewa. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Ishini ake muwa lo ni, abyo Ojason kpa ayene shishini gebe ka awigabo ko ogya kweyi aba ngmegba mo, &lt;&lt;Ango mani yase gbotu ka agye lo ebebenya. Anani awo ogya kaha wa, <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />kweyi Ojason kpuwa shole nu. Aba yono ko ose ko Oroma yi kyigbo, ba kamo ose oye nyakwu ki yaba, miye nu wo, Oyesu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Ishini awigabo kpase ko ogya pwoshu mani ni, otuwa bya kotata. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Ebeni awigabo yo Ojason kpa ayene shishini zi ikwiri ome ana shuwa bita naga.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ipu ko Oberiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Ni otu bi ni, ayene to Obulus kpo Osila oleho go Oberiya. Ni afebe ni, age ekpa ko Oyahuda. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Ase ko Oberiya wawine kotu mene sha ase ko Otasalonika, ikweyi koni aba yimu ko pwela ni Obulus ya ka ni, kweyi aba gyokpa ko Owuso ishi kpiri shini anama kwe oza ni ofu ni gyogye. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Ase ko yahuda nwashika kyogwu, mamani nwashika ka anya ko Ogirik ni aba muwa gyiyi ni kyogwu kpa ango ko Ogirik nwashika kyogwu. <verse eid="ACT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Ishini Ase ko Oyahuda ni bo Otesalonika pwo mo Obulus ya tono kela ko Owuso Oberiya ni, agebe ni ga kpase tukpa shini ana gbapwo. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Ebebeni abyo Obulus oshi go okwunu ki ishu, Osila kpo Otimoti ke bagye Oberiya. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Awase ni byo Obulus oshi ga Atina ni ba kwikye go Oberiya ni, akwikye kpo oleho ko Obulus mo Osila kpo Otimoti mana ga tanu papa, kweyi aga.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ipu ka Atina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Ishini Obulus ya gbeyi ko Osila kpo Otimoti ogya ka Atina ni, otu nu bya kotata, koni omole keka ebebe nya ipu ko ogya ni. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Mani oni Ogipu kekpa ga kela kpa awase ko Oyahuda kpa awase ni wo Oyahuda lo ni gboshi ko Owuso ni, oya gopu kurutu ga kela kpa awase ni ya akpaha tagye danu ni. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Ikpo ka awofoza inokpa ke Epikuriya kpa awase ni aba yuwogwu mo Ostoyiki, wa tawashu kpo Obulus. Ashini wa doka mo, &lt;&lt;Oji ni ikyo mani ya ka ni? Ashini kamo, &lt;&lt;Ole byo oya tono kela kaweka ni wako okpagye kaha lo ni.&gt;&gt; Aka mani ikweyi koni Obulus ya tono kela ko Oyesu dawa kpo onyiso nu bwi ikwu. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Ebeni ayo Obulus kwu Ariyopagus, kweyi byo go obutu ka Arupagu ni wonongbo ko gya ni, kweyi adoka mo, &lt;&lt;Aba yimu ko gyoza pepe ni oya fu mani. <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Oza ni oya fu mani kpiri woza pepe ebe kaha, aba yimu ko gyikweyi nu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />Kpiri kase ka Atina kpawase ni wo ogboga ni bogya ni yimu ko zishi wa kpiri ko kela ikweyi koza fofu pepe mani ko ki zakpaha danu.<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Ebeni Obulus nyiso hagye otutehe ka awonongbo kweyi kamo, &lt;&lt;Ala ase ka Atina! Nmala ba yela ko owuso gogo-gogo. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Ishini nyya gyehe kpiri ipu ko ogya ni, nma awoza ni ala ba geyagye danu ni, nmo okpe oye ko opeshi ni atenena anu mo: DO OWUSO NI ASHISHE GYO LONI. Nabani oza ni ala ba geyagye danu ni ala gyelo ni, anu pini nyya kela ikweyi nu dala ma.<verse eid="ACT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />&lt;&lt;Owuso ni yese kpo ojoji kpiri ni bipu nu ni anu pini wa Adole ki iso kpo okpagye la, oya yole ni ase ma kpabo ni lo. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Oya yimu kojije ebe kasuse lo, ikweyi koni anu pini dase olayi kpo olayi, kpo oza ni ase ba yimu ni. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Bwebe kase oye oya asuse kpiri, kweyi oyuwa bagye ebe gogo-gogo ipu kese. Anu abiyinu yishi kpeji kebe ni aba bagye ni. <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />Owuso ya mani shini ana tikpo nu, kwe aba ba mo. Koni Owuso ke lenu kpaha lo. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />Byoni ashe kamo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 17:28">&lt;Aha bipu nu, ba yawu anu, kweyi agbo olayi anu.&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 17:28">Byoni awo wigye kala ba kamo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 17:28">&lt;Aha wayi nu mamani la.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />Byoni aha wayi ko Owuso ni, ahan kama byo oyi ko Owuso lema byo ozinariya kwe azurupa kwe ikyikpo ni ase kpo bwebe koko kabo nu ni lo. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Ishini ase gye lo ni Owuso ya kwuwe pwo koza labi wa lo. Nabani ke oka dase kpiri ebebenya mo ana shagbotu. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Ikweyi koni oteno kowa kepwo kokwokwoshi ikweyi kananoho ipu kese bwebe kase ni oshu ko kepwo ni. Oshiya aha mo omani gbawashu lo, koni oya anu oni nyiso bwikwu ni!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Ishini apwo Obulus ya kela ikweyi ko nyiso ikwu ni, ashini kase yo pya woza keye, kweyi ashini kamo, &lt;Aba yimu ko ki pwela mani ebe wo komwepa.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Ebeni Obulus sho ogbayi bita. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Ashini kase kyogwu kweyi zela ko Obulus. Ipu wa wo Odiyosiyus, oye ipu ko onongbo kpo onya oye iye nu wo Odamari kpa ashini kase.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s">Ipu ko Okorentus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Itikpi ko mani, Obulus sha Atina bita go Okorentus. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Ebeni ogbayi kpo Oyahuda oye ni, iyenu wa Akwila ni, amo Opontus ni bwo okpagye ki Itali wa gbeji wa loni, kpo onyanu ko Oprisila, ikweyi koni Ose Okladiya zoko mo ase ko Oyahuda nibo okpagye ko Oroma ni na shogya bita. Obulus ga muwa, <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />ikweyi koni otoyu wa woye kponu, ka adaba ko gwogwo ni, oyagye kweyi ya kpa awa. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Eno kominyo kpiri oya ga kela kpase ipu kekpa, shini kase ko Oyahuda ka awo Ogirik shini ana zela nu.<verse eid="ACT 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Ishini Osila kpo Otimoti bwo Omasedoniya wani, Obulus zishi nu ya tono koshu neshi, oya yolobene da Ase ko Oyahuda mo, Oyesu wo Omezaya la. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Ishini awoyahuda ke bato Obulus awashu kweyi aba sesa, ogwo omula koshiye nu kweyi kadawa mo, &lt;&lt;Owoni ala nyowe, ala mobibi kiyi kala! Abo hin yanu lo. Bwikyeni gohobu, nyya gebe kawase ni wo oyahuda lo ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Ebeni Obulus shekpa bita kweyi gole ko Otitiyos Ojostus, ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni ya geyagye do Owuso ni ga yagye; ole nu kwe ekpa oni. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Okrispus ni woteyi kekpa, kpase kipwoma nu kpiri kyogwu kpela ka Adole; ase ko Okorentus nwashika ni pwela nuni kyogwu kweyi ayuwo obatisma.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Otu ke enoye Adole gwo Obulus iyi kweyi kela kpanu mo, &lt;&lt;Kayoshi lo, ke gohobu ko kela dawa ka gbo otu lo, <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />Koni nyyo kpa awo ni. Ashishe ya gege koyo ojije kponu lo, ikweyi koni ase nwashika ipu ko ogya mani wase hin la.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Mani oni Obulus yagye ebe ni ishayi oye kpo oya ihiri ya fuwela ko Owuso.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Ishini Ogaliyo woteyi ko okpagye ka Akaya ni, ase ko Oyahuda ni bebeni yokwunu wa gbayi kweyi ayo Obulus kwu, byo goda kepwo. <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />Akamo, &lt;&lt;Ongo mani ya kpase okwunu mana geyagye do Owuso ni ono kaha wobi ni!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Ishini Obulus ya yimu ko kela ni, Ogaliyo kada ase ko Oyahuda mo, &lt;&lt;Owoni ela mani pini ala kamo oyoza bibi kwe oyoje la, oni biya yun ya gbotu mene kpala ase ko Oyahuda. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Ni oke wawashu ikweyi kiye kpela kpo ono kala la ni, owotiri shala abiyikala kyela kala gwo. Nyya wino kepwo ikweyi kela mani lo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Ebeni onuwenya shoda ko kepwo. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Ebeni kpiri wa pya wikweyi ko Osostenes oteyi kekpa, kweyi agwofunu koda kepwo. Oni ke shiwo ko Ogaliyo lo kpiri kpiri.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Obulus Kwikye ga Antakiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Obulus yagye ke eno nwashika kpawo okyogwu Okorentus, ebe ni oshuwa bita kweyi sheyi kishu gebe ko Oprisila kpa Akwila ko Osiriya. Ome ana sheyi kishu, ko Okiriniya aweyikweyi kene ni ogwa ni. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Ishini afo Efesu ni, ebe ni Obulus sho Oprisila kpa Akwila bita. Kweyi gekpa ga kela kpase ko Oyahuda. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Abo mona yagye kpawa kishi gbayayi, oke tanu. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Ishini oya ga ni, oke kadawa mo, &lt;&lt;Owoni Owuso kyogwu, nyya kwikye yawebe kala.&gt;&gt; Ebeni osheyi bwishu ke Efesu. <verse eid="ACT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Ishini ofo Okesariya ni, ogo Ojerusele ga tawo gboso Oyesu ogbogba, ebe ni ogogya ka Antakiya. <verse eid="ACT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Obulus yagye kpawa kishi gbayayi ebe ni, oshebe ni bita gokpagye ko Ogalatiya kpo Ofrijiya kweyi ya tawogboso Oyesu otugbagba.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apolos ge Efesu kpo Okorentus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Ishoni ongo ko Oyahuda oye iyenu wa Apolos, owase ka Alegzandiriya, owe Efesu. Ogishi ko kela neshi dase, ogyawo okpa ko Owuso kotata. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Afela ka Adole kweyi owoni oya kela oyagye mela nu wela neshi kweyi oya foza ikweyi ko Oyesu. Ogyoza ikweyi ko obatisma ko Oyohana kin la. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Okwotu kokela gboshi lo ipu kekpa. Ishini Oprisila kpa Akwila pwo ni, apanu mona golewa kweyi oga kyogwu kela ko Owuso.<verse eid="ACT 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Na Apolos ya yimu koga Akaya ni, awokyogwu Efesu tabo kweyi atenena da awogboso Akaya mo, anazo kpabo epepa. Ishini ofebe ni, otawase ni bwebe ko neshi ko Owuso akyogwu ni otuwabo nwashika. <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Otawashu loshu kpase ko Oyahuda iyi kase kweyi ogwuwagye, oshawa bwokpa ko Owuso mo Oyesu pini wo Omezaya la.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s1">Obulus Gogya ke Efesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Ishini Apolos tayayo yo Okorentus ni, Obulus yawu okpagye gbishini oge Efesu. Ebeni oga gbayi kpa awogboso. <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />Oduwoka mo, &lt;&lt;Omaku ko Owuso sadala ishini ala kyogwu ni?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:2">Ebeni aka danu mo, &lt;&lt;Ayi, apwoje kponu ikweyi ko Omaku ko Owuso lo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Ebeni Obulus duwoka mo, &lt;&lt;Edo ko obatisma wonya ni ayala?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:3">Akamo, &lt;&lt;Obatisma ko Oyohana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Obulus kamo, &lt;&lt;Kokwokwoshi Oyohana yo obatisma kawase ni shagbotu shozalabi wa ni; Oya kadase Izrayila mo, ana kyogwu kpase ni yawa itikpi nu ni wo Oyesu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Ishini apwo mani ni, ebe ni ayuwo obatisma ipu kiye ka Adole Oyesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Ishini Obulus suwabo ikweyi ni, Omaku ko Owuso sa ikweyi wa, kweyi ako ose gogo-gogo kweyi atono kela ko Owuso. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Kpiri wa wase igwepa.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Ebeni Obulus gipu kekpa kweyi oga yagye ya kela kpawa gboshi lo koya eta, oyagye kpawa kela kpawa ikweyi ko Obula ko Owuso. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Ashini wa ke zakpaha kweyi atawa ko kyogwu, aba kela labi da awogboso iyi kase. Ebeni Obulus shuwa bita kweyi oya awogboso ogwu ga kpanu kweyi oya fuwoza kweneno oda ko foza ko Otiranus. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Obulus yawoza mani kishayi epa, gbishini ase ko Oyahuda kpawo Ogirik kpiri ni bokpagye ka Asiya pwela ka Adole.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayi ko Osiba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Owuso do Obulus oshu ko yawoza kigbashi nyakwu ni gbodagye ebyibye wa lo ni, <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />akpo oshosha kayiki ko wehe nu kpo oshiye nu gebe kawino gbere, apyo ogege kweyi omaku bibi bose shikpiye wa. <verse eid="ACT 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Ashini kase ko Oyahuda ba gyehe ba ngmo omaku bibi ikpiye kawine kere aba yoko kpiye ka Adole Oyesu ko yo mani. Aba kado omaku bibi mo, &lt;&lt;Nnala enya ipu kiye ko Oyesu ni Obulus ya tono kela nu ni mala bose.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Ayi ko Osiba ni wo Oteyi kawosapa ko Oyahuda ase ahapa pini bose baya mani la.<verse eid="ACT 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Enoye omaku bibi ke kadawa mo, &lt;&lt;Ngyo Oyesu, ngyo Obulus, ala ke wanoho?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Ongo ni gbo Omaku bibi ni nonu kpawa, kweyi oshu nu sha kakawa kpiri. Anyinya bose ipu kole nu, kpofo ni oyuwa ni kpo oshiye shosha. <verse eid="ACT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Ebeni kpiri ko Oyahuda kpawase ni wo Oyahuda lo ni be Efesu ni apwoshu mani; kweyi oshi yuwa kwu kotata, kweyi adiye ka Adole Oyesu abokpa nyakwu. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Nwashika wa ni kyogwu ni, kweyi wa shagbotu koza ni. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Nwashika kawase ni ba yabodiyi ni kpawo okpa wa tukpa ese kweyi ayi yola iyi ka ananoho. Ishini ayarisawu kawo kpa mani owa azurupa okpakwu aweho. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Mani oni Oshu mani yela ko Owuso ge ebebenya kweyi ki loshu.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akpefu Efesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Ni awoza mani kweyi ni, Obulus gbo otu nu kogo Omasedoniya kpo, Akaya kweyi ki shigbo go Ojerusele. Okamo owotiri ni nyya ga mo oroma ni. <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Ebeni oto Otimoti kpo Erastu asepa niba yoko kpanu ni oleho go Omasedoniya, anu abiyinu yagye gboji agbabo ka Asiya.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Ipu kishi mani apwo nyakwu nyiso ogya ke Efesu ikweyi ko owe ni Adole shu. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Ashe iyenu wo Odemetriyus, oyoyi keka nonya ni yo ofonu ka Atemis kpa azurupa kweyi otoyu nu byikwiri wa dawo yoko kpanu kotata. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Ni oyuwo gwu kpiri, kpawase ni ba yedo koko wa ni kweyi okadawa mo, &lt;&lt;Ango, alagye mo, odu kaha wa bwebe koko mani. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Nabani, alama ki pwo abiyikala oza ni Obulus yaya ni. Okamo eka ni aya kpabo ni wo Owuso lalo, oya gbishi ni oyotu kase kpiri yikwu, kipu ke Efesu kpe ebebenya okpagye ka Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Ni olemani oni, ebi yaba, ikweyi koni otoyu kaha ya yishi. Omani kin lalo, ebi yawa ba ikweyi koni ole ke eka nyakwu ka Atemis ya wojije kelo. Oshu nyakwu no gbo mani ya wojije lo, kweyi ashishe ipu kokpagye ka asiya kpese kpiri ya geyagye danu kelo.<verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Ni ewa pwela mani ni, otuwa bya, kweyi asheha mo olayi wo nayo gbogbo eka nyakwu Atemis ke Efesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Ebeni ogya kpiri gyoza ni aba yani kelo: kweyi apa yo Ogayos kpo Aristakus kwu, ase ko Omasedoniya, awoya, kiyawu ko Obulus apyuwa gebe ni ase kogya tukpa ni. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Ebeni Obulus yimu ko gipu kewa kweyi awogboso kyogwu lo. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Mani oni, awigabo ko okpagye, awoya ko Obulus, atoleho baba mo, naka sayi nu ebeni ewa tukpa ni lo,<verse eid="ACT 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Ogbayi kya, ase shini ba ngmegba ba koje, ashini ba koje oye hoha: kweyi nwashika kase gyoza ni kpuwa wa gbayi nilo. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Ebeni ase ko oyahuda sa Alekzanda abo wohobu kewa, ashini kamo ogbabo ela mani. Kweyi Alekzanda yase abo mo ana sha, shini ona nyepwo kiyi nu. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Ni ke agye mo, owo Ase ko Oyahuda la ni, kpiri wa ngmegba oko oye kponu, ba kamo olayi wo nayo gbogbo eka onyakwu ko Atemis, eka ko Efesu.<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Ogwejeji ino tenena ko ogya yase sha. Okamo, ayene hin ke Efesu, ananoho gye mo, ogya ke Efesu webe ni ole keka nyakwu ka Atemis yanu ni, mamani ikyikpo ni gbo bwi iso ni ase ba geyagye danu ni ye Efesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Ashishe ya gege ya tawashu kawoza mani lo. Mani oni ala byowu kala weye, ka yoje ni ya byela wa ni lo. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Ala byawa ango mani webeni, koni ayojije nu shole keka kaha lo, ake yeka ka ojije lo. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Ni olemani oni, owoni Odemetriyus kpawo ya koko nu gbepwo kpashe, oda ko kepwo, kpa awo teyi baba; ana ga kepwo wa ebeni. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Owoni ala ke gboje ni shomani, owo tiri shini ala ko owe neshi ogbayi ko okpagye. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Itikpi koza ni gbodagye ikyeni, byoni olemani aha bipu kela nyakwu. Aha gbepwo oyoye koshu ikweyi kapwo mani lo, aha ba gege ko ngmiyika shela mani lo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Ni okela mani kweyi ni, oya ananoho ganu.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s">Ipu ko Omakidoniya kpo Ogirik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Ishini apwo ka agye ni, Obulus yawogboso gwu kweyi tuwotugbagba kamo Owuso na gbaha. Ebeni oshuwa bita kweyi go Omasedoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Obwa agbabo oni kpiri kweyi ya tase otugbagba. Ebeni owo Akaya, <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />oyagye ebe ni koya eta. Oya wiyinushu kogo Osiriya ishini ogye mawa Oyahuda ba gbela bibi ikweyi nu; ebe ni okwikye bwako Omasedoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Ebeni Osopata oyi ko Opiros bwo Oberiya, Aristakus kpo Osekondus bwo Otasalonika; Ogayos bwo Odabi; Otikyikwus kpo Otrofimus bwagbabo ka Asiya, kpo Otimoti byoshi. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Abo ohobu ga gbeyi kaha Otrowas. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Aha sheyi ki ishu bwo Ofilipi ishini arimya ki ikyoga ni gbo oyisi lo ni kweyi ni, kweyi itikpi keno eho aha ga tawa Otrowas, kweyi abebeni kobize oye.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Obulus Go Otrowas ko Gwejeji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Eno ko ominyo onose agbayi ko rema kozarore. Obulus kela dawa, Obulus kela dase kweyi yipu ko kela gbishini otubi, koni ebe nya oya ganu ni. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Akwola emu nwashika ipu koda ki iso ebe ni aha gbayi ni. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Isongo oye iyenu we Eyutiko yagye ofunu-owu, ni Obulus yipu kela ya ka, ola yo Eyutiko bize gebe lenu gbishini ofa gbo bwo oda ki iso komweta wo okpagye. Ishini anganu iso ni ogekwu. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Obulus ke sa wokpagye kweyi wa gboso kweyi kwo botu. Okamo, &lt;&lt;Ala ka byotu lo, otayayo yiyi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Ebeni Obulus kwikye goda ki iso, ga roza ka Adole kpawo gboso. Ni okela dawa gbeji ni, gbishini ebenya, Obulus nyiso kiyawu. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Abyi isongo oni gole kpo olayi kweyi ashotunehe ipu ko tuwa nwashika.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bwo Otrowas go Omelitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Ebeni aha kwohobu kweyi gipu kowu kinyo sheyi ki ishu ga Aso, ebe ni aha baga zo Obulus. Ogbo mani ikweyi koni oya yawu kikpo. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Kweyi, ishini otaha Aso ni, aha zo gipu kowu kweyi byo go Omitilene. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Ebeni, asheyi ki ishu go Okiyos eno ko omwepa. Itikpi ke eno oye afo Osamos. Kweyi eno komwepa afo Omiletus. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Ikweyi koni Obulus gbo ko bwe Efesu, shini naka ngmishi oyagye ka Asiya lo. Koni oya yawu papa ko go Ojerusele, enoni weno ki Imya ko Opetiko, owoni oya gege.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Obulus Kela ko Gwejeji Danyakwase ke Efesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Bwo Omiletus Obulus otoleho go Efesu, kweyi ka danyakwase ko gboso Oyesu mana ga tanu. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Kweyi ishini awebe ni, okadawa mo, &lt;&lt;Ala gyojoji ni nyya ishini nyyo kpala, bwikyikyo ke eno ni nwo okpagye ka Asiya ni. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />Nyya yoko hin kweyi zikweyi iso lo kpize iyi byo oyole ka Adole, ishini ase ko Oyahuda ba tikpo ko yun ngmo ni. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Ala gye mo nteba koza niya talabo ni dala lo, ishini nyya tono ya foza ese kpo ole kala ni. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Npyase ko Oyahuda kpa awase ni wo Oyahuda lo ni akpaha ko shagbotu kweyi kwikye webe ko Owuso kweyi kyogwu kpa Adole Oyesu. <verse eid="ACT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />Anani ikweyi ko ni geyagye do Omaku ko Owuso nyya go Ojerusele, koni ngyoza ni yaga tami ebe ni lo. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Ozani nggye ni wo, Omaku ko Owuso pyumakpaha mo ogya kpiri ni nga ela kpo oruduru ba gbeyi hin. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Ami ke ya byotu kpoza ni yawa tami ni lo, oneshi nu wa koni na ngmeyi koko ni Adole Oyesu dami ni. Oko ni wako kadase oshu neshi ikweyi keshi ko Owuso.<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />&lt;&lt;Ami gyehe ipu kala kpiri, ya tono ko Obula ko Owuso. Kweyi ngye mo ashishe ipu kala ya miyi hin kelo. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Mani oni, Ami ka dala ikyeni: owoni ashe kala nyowe, ngbabo ipunu lo. <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />Ikweyi koni, Ami ya kwikye itikpi ko koshu kpela ko Owuso kpiri dala lo. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Alagbera kpiyikala, kpa awobize kpiri ni Omaku ko Owuso dala ko yiyi kwo ni. Ala wawine ko gbeho koda Owuso, ni oya wakakanu bwebe ko oyi ko Oyi nu ni. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Ami gye mo itikpi koni nga hin, awiwo-pashi ba wipu kala, kweyi aba yala ofo. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Ishi yawa ba ni ashini bwipu kikpo kala ba shokame ko kpawo kyogwu shini anagbosu wa. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Ni olemani, ala gbera! Ala ra mo ipu kishayi eta nshibita ko pyala akpaha lo kotu ke eno kpize iyi hin. <verse eid="ACT 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />Kweyi nabani, inya bo Owuso ikweyi kala, kpela keshi nu, ni talabo ni, ni ki ya dala aboneshi ni Owuso gbo dase nu ni. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Nyya mehe kiyo ka ashishe lo, azurupa, ozinariya, kwe iyo kikpiye. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Ala, abiyikala gye mo, abo hin yoko kweyi npyoza kpiri ni ami kpa awase ni bagye kpami ni ba yimu. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Ipu koza kpiri ni nyya ya, nyya shala mo ahan takirikwu shini ntawase ni gbojije lo ni abo, shini ahan rela ni Adole Oyesu ka ni, &lt;Otunehe yo kpase ni zeshi shase ni nye ni.<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Ishini Obulus kela mani kweyi ni, okwagye kpawa dudu kweyi tinarigwu. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Akwo Obulus botu, kweyi ba kyegba kamo Owuso na gbaha. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Abyotu kela kpiri ni okani mo aba miyiwa kelo. Kweyi abyoshi gowu kinyo.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s1">Obulus go Ojerusele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Aha kamo Owuso na gbaha kweyi aga kaha. Ni asheyi ki ishu ni, ago Okos; gbebenya nu aha go Orodes, bwebe ni ago Opatara. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Ebeni aha pyowu niya go Ofunisiya ni, aha gipu kweyi nyiso kiyawu. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Nawa febe ni aba mo Osipros ni, aha bwekye nu go Osiriya. Aga sa ega ko Otaya, Ebeni owu kinyo kaha yiyo sa ni. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Ebeni amawo kyogwu kweyi abagye kpawa kobize oye. Bwebe koshu ko Omaku ko Owuso aka do Obulus mona ka go Ojerusele lo. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Ishini eno ke gye ni, aha shuwabita ga kaha. Kpiri wa, kanya wa kpa ayi wa byahoshi bose ipu ko ogya gokwunu kishi, ebe ni kpiri kaha kwagye kweyi tinarigwu. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Ebeni akamo Owuso na gbaha kpiyi ka, kweyi aga kpo owu awa ke kwikye go ole.<verse eid="ACT 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Aha gohobu kpiyawu kaha ka ayene, asheyi bwo Otaya go Otolemayis, ebeni aga togbogba kpawogboso kweyi abagye kpawa ke eno oye. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Eno ko omwepa aha shuwabita kweyi go Okesariya. Aga bole ko Ofilibus ino tono, oye ipu kase ahapa ni ashu Ojerusele ni. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Ogbayi nonya ene ni gboba lo ni, aba tono kela ko Owuso.<verse eid="ACT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Aha yeno nwashika ebe ni ome inobane oye niye nu wo Agabus ni wa bwo Oyahudiya. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Owebe kaha, owa zogbogbo kogbeyi ko Obulus, yi gbiyinu ikpo kpabo, kweyi kamo, &lt;&lt;Ozani Omaku ko Owuso kani yoma: ine ko gbogbo mani Awoyahuda ni bo Ojerusele ba yo ya gbo mani, kweyi aba yo nabo dawase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Naha pwela mani ni, kpiri kaha kpawase ni bebeni, abo Obulus mona ka go Ojerusele lo. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Ebeni, Obulus ke kyogwu mo, &lt;&lt;Ojiya ni ala ba kyegba mani, ko yotu ni na bya? Nkwobonu wiyunshu wa, ko gbumogwa kin lalo, ayimu ana yun ngmo Ojerusele ikweyi kiye ka Adole Oyesu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Aka ma ka ma kpiri okyogwu lo, mani oni aha shobita kweyi kamo, &lt;&lt;Oza na Adole yimu ni na gbodagye.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Aha zishi gbayayi ebe ni ome aha liyo, kweyi ago Ojerusele. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Awogboso ko Okesariya ga kpaha mamani, abyaha gole kase ni aba ga bagye kpanu ni iye nu wo Omunason bwo Osipros, owinogboso nekye-nekye.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obulus Gebe ko Oyakubu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Ishini aha sa Ojerusele ni, awogboso yahomaba ka ayene neneshi. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Gbebenya, aga kpo Obulus ga mo Oyakubu; anyakwase koda ko Owuso kpiri bebeni. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Obulus tuwogbogba kweyi shuwepwo kojoji ni Owuso ya bwebe koko nu ipu kawase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni. <verse eid="ACT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Ni apwela nu ni, kpiri wa sho Owuso iye. Ebeni akamo, &lt;&lt;Oyene Obulus, mase ko Oyahuda okpaku nwashika ni kyogwu ni, kweyi kpiri wa ba zotu wa ba byono ko Omusa loshu-loshu. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Ake ka dawa moya fase ko Oyahuda ni bokpagye ni wako Oyahuda lo ni oza mana nwanyi ono ko Omusa, amoya kamo ana ka shayi wa ofu lo ake naka kodu ko Oyahuda lo. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Oke wotiri shana pwo mowa. Aba yamoji yoni? <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />Ozani aba yimu sho ya ni yoma. Aha gbango ene ebe ni akwobonu gwene. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Ga kpawa shala ga yodu ko nikpiye dudu, kweyi awo sore kikwiri wa; shini ana winyeyi wa. Bwebe koni ananoho ya gye moza ni aka dawa ikweyi wo ni wokwokwoshi lalo, ake bagye mawo abiyo ya ko Ono ko Omusa. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Ela kawase ni ke wase ko Oyahuda lo ni kyogwu ni, aha kwobonu tokpa ga dawa mo, ana ka hoza ni ayipeka ni lo, ala hoyi lo, ana ka hebe kobize na babo oro ni lo, ake naka beba lo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Mani oni eno ko omwepa Obulus kpango oni ga kweyi ka yodu ko nikpiye kpawa. Ebeni ogipu kole ko Owuso ko ga ke eno ni shishini dawa ko yodu kweyi ni, enoni, aba peshi ikweyi wa oyoye.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayo Obulus Kwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Ishini eno ahapa wa ke ya gya ni, awase ko Oyahuda ni bwagbabo ko Asiya ni mo Obulus ipu kole ko Owuso. Akpase kpiri okwunu kweyi ayo Obulus kwu. <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />Aba ngmegba kamo, &lt;&lt;Ango ki Izrayila ala tahabo! Ongo oni pi yoma, ni ya ge ebebenya ya fase kpiri oza bibi ikweyi kase ki Izrayila, kpo Ono ko Omusa kpo ole ko Owuso mani. Anani obyawase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni wipu kole ko Owuso ko byinyi webe sere mani. <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />Aka mani ikweyi koni amo Otrofimus ni bwo Efesu ni kpo Obulus ipwogya, aba ma byo Obulus byo wipu kole ko Owuso la.<verse eid="ACT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Ebeni ogya kya, kweyi ase ba nyinya bwagbabo wonyonya, akwo Obulus, apyo bwipu kole ko Owuso wese, kweyi ebebeni ayopwunu kole ko Owuso gwu. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Naba yimu ko yongmo ni, oshu gebe ko oteyi kawadakare ko Oroma, mogya ko Ojerusele kya gidi-gidi. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Ebebeni okpawigabo kpa awadakare kweyi nyinya ga tawa. Namo kpa awadakare ni agwo Obulus kelo.<verse eid="ACT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Oteyi kawadakare gobutu ko Obulus ga yokwu, kweyi ozoko mana yo gbo kpa ashirika epa. Ebeni odoka mo, &lt;&lt;Ongo mani wanoho, oji noya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Ase ba ngmegba ba kela gogo-gogo, ase ashini ba koje, ashini ke ba koje hoha. Ela ba ga gogo-gogo oteyi kadakare gyikwikweyi gyoza ni gbodagye ni lo, mani oni omana byo Obulus gebe ko bagye kawadakare. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Ishini afebe kokpe ko toshi ni, awadakare nganu ngonga, ikweyi koni otu ke ewa bya. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Ewa kasuse gboso ba ngmegba kamo, &lt;&lt;Yo ngmo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obulus Nyepwo Kiyinu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Ishini adakare ba byo Obulus gipu kebe koyagye kadakare ni, oka do oteyi kawadakare mo, &lt;&lt;Oya kyogwu na kela dawo?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 21:37">Oteyi kadakare doka mo, &lt;&lt;Ogishi ko kose ko Ogirik? <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />Awo pini wase ki Ijip ni yase ba gwakpaha kweyi kpawo ngmase okpaku ene ni byiyo kefu ni gipu kimweshi ishi oye lalo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Obulus kyogwu kamo, &lt;&lt;Nwwase ko Oyahuda la, amun Otarsus kokpagye ko Okilikiya, nwwase ko ogya nyakwu la. Kweyi Nyya bo, yun na kela dawase mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Oteyi kadakare danoshu ko kela, mani oni Obulus hagye ikweyi kokpe ko toshi ya sabo mana sha. Ishini asha ni, Obulus kela dawa okwunu kose Ibru:<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />&lt;&lt;Ayene hin ko Oyahuda, ala yakpaha tagye shini ala pwo oza ni nyya kadala ikweyi giyun ni!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Ishini apwo ya kela dawa kpose ko Ibru ni, asha din, kweyi Obulus gohobu ko kela: <verse eid="ACT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />Ami wo ase ko Oyahuda, amun ogya ko Otarsus okpagye ko Okilikiya ake byun gye ipu ko Ojerusele nwwoyi kinokpa ko Ogamaliyel. Ofumoza gyogye ikweyi ko ono kawa Ada kaha, nzotu hin do Owuso neneshi byoni ala ba ya ikyeni mani. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />Ami dase no ba gbosowe mani egye ko gekwu tanu. Nkwango kpa anya shipu ko shetu. <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />Oteyi kawosapa kpo Onongbo baka dala moza ni nyya ka mani wo kwokwoshi la. Nzokpa ni ata bwebewa ko ga dawayene ko Oyahuda ni bipu ko Odamasko ni, bwebe ni nkwowe ko ga kwuwa ase mani shashirika ko kwikye awa wo Ojerusele, shini ana dawe egye.<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Obulus Kela Ikweyi ko Shagbotu nu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />Ishini nkwowe yaga ni nyyo pee kpo Odamasko, abo kisheno, ebe ni oyoyu nyakwu bwi iso yawu gyehe tun. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Ebeni, ngbo okpagye, kweyi npwoko kela bwi iso ya kadami mo, &lt;Oshawulu, Oshawulu! Ojiya ni oya dami egye?&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />Kweyi ndoka mo, &lt;Adole awo wanoho?&gt; Okadami mo, &lt;Ami Oyesu ko Onazaret ni Oya dami egye ni. <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Ebeni, awase ni yawu kpami ni mebe yayu oni, ake pwoko kase ni ya kela kpami ni lo. <verse eid="ACT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Ebeni ndoka mo, nyya ya moji, Adole? Kweyi Adole ka dami mo, &lt;&lt;&lt;Nyiso shini ogo Odamasko, ebe ni aba kawoza kpiri ni Owuso ya yimu shini oya ni dawo.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Nmebe kelo kpoyoyu kola mani, ebe ni awase ni yawu kpami ni pyumabo byun go Odamasko.<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />Ipu kokpagye oni ashe aba yo mo Ananiya, owase ko Owuso ni ya geyagye dono kaha, kweyi kpiri kawase ko Oyahuda ni bebeni ba geyagye danu. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />Owa tami, kweyi hagye ebe hin, okadami mo, &lt;Oyene hin Oshawulu, kyi mebe!&gt; Ebebeni nmebe kweyi nkyi mo. <verse eid="ACT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Okamo, &lt;Owuso kawa Ada kaha sho shi ni ogyoza kotu nu, shini oki mayole nu aseneshi, kweyi shino opwela ni oyaka kpo okwunu nu. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Shini owiwene nu ko kadase kpiri oza ni oma kpoza ni opwo ni. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Anani mani, oya gbishi koji ke? Nyiso shino oyo obatisma, shina yozalabi wo na shonu, bwebe ko tinarigwu danu.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayo Obulus Ogwu ko Tono Dawase ni Wase ko Oyahuda lo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />&lt;&lt;Nkwikye itikpi go Ojerusele, ishini nyya tinarigwu ipu kole ko Owuso, nmebe, <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />Ebeni, nma Adole, byoni okadami mo, &lt;Yawu shino obose sho Ojerusele ta papa, ikweyi koni awase mani aba zela ni oya ka ikweyi hin nilo.<verse eid="ACT 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />Ebeni nkamo, &lt;Adole,&gt; &lt;Agye mo nggekpa ga kwase ni kyogwu kpawo ni gwo. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />Ishini ayo Ostivi ngmo ni, Ami abiyun yebe ni, in hagye ebe ni ba, nkyogwu mo, ana yongmo shini na kposhiye kawase ni yongmo ni bi.<verse eid="ACT 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />Adole kadanu mo, &lt;Ga,&gt; &lt;Ikweyi koni Ami ya tuwoleho gebe lenu ebe kawase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Awase mani yakpaha tagye gbishini Obulus kela kweyi, akwotu ko sheha kpoko nyakwu mo, Ala byo ga yo ngmo! Ikweyi koni oshu koyiyi lo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Ishini aba shegba ni ayoshiye wa ngma kweyi fagye myi giso. <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />Onyakwase kawadakare ko Oroma zoko dayole nu mo, ana byo Obulus go ofonu wa, shini ana ya aboshi; shini ana gyoza ni yuwa ba ngmegba mani ikweyi nuni. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Ishini ake yo gbo ko ya aboshi ni, Obulus kado oteyi kadakare ni hagye beeyi ni mo, &lt;&lt;Owono neshi ebe kala shini ala gwase ko Oroma ni gbepwo kojije lo ni?<verse eid="ACT 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Ishini anyakwase kadakare pwo mani ni, oga doteyi wa oka mo, &lt;&lt;Oji ni oyaya ni? Ongo mani wase ko Oroma la!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Mani oni, oteyi kadakare webe ko Obulus wa doka mo, &lt;&lt;Kadami, owase ko Oroma la?&gt;&gt; Obulus kyogwu kamo, &lt;&lt;Een,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Ebeni, oteyi kadakare kamo, &lt;&lt;Kpikwiri nwashika pini nwwase kebe mani la.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:28">Obulus ke kamo, &lt;&lt;Ami woyi moma kokpagye mani la.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Ebebeni, awase ni wa ko do Obulus oka kela ni shobita kweyi anyakwase kadakare otu nu bya ni owa gye mo Obulus wase ko Oroma pini oshashirika ni.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Obulus Wobutu ko Onongbo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Oteyi kawadakare ya yimu ko gye kwela koji ni ase ko Oyahuda kwo Obulus kpanu; mani oni ebenya nu oya ashirika yi yi kweyi oya awosapa nyakwu kpawo onongbo kpiri mo anagbayi. Kweyi obyo Obulus wahagye obutuwa.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Obulus yiyi kwo onongbo tiriri kweyi kamo, &lt;&lt;Ayene hin ki Izrayila! Nshotunehe ikweyi kolayi hin ebe ko Owuso gbeno kikyeni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Ebeni Oteyi kawosapa Ananiya ka dawase ni hagye kpo Obulus ni mo ana labo okwunu. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Obulus kada Ananiya mo, &lt;&lt;Owuso ya labo okwunu mamani, awo ino yoza iyi! Oyagye ebe ni ko kwumepwo byoni ono kani, awo abiyo ke ya gboso ono lo mana lumabo akpaha!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Ango ni hagye kpo Obulus ni kadanu mo, &lt;&lt;Oya so Oteyi kawosapa ko Owuso esa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Obulus kamo, &lt;&lt;Ayene hin ki Izrayila ngye mo owo Oteyi kawosapa lalo. Okpa ko Owuso kamo, &lt;Kakela labi ikweyi kawo oteyi kase kala lo.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Ishini Obulus gye mo ashini kikpo wo Osadusi, kweyi ashini kikpo wo Ofarisi ni, okado onongbo mo, &lt;&lt;Ayene hin ki Izrayila! Ami wo Ofarisi, ada hin ni mun ni wo Ofarisi la. Ayun kwu webe mani ikweyi kotuse nigbo mo, Owuso yase ni gekwu ya nyiso ikwu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Ni oka mani ni, awashu nyiso otutehe kawo Ofarisi kpo Osadusi, kweyi ayiyiwa ko ikpo. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />(Koni awo Osadusi kamo onyiso ikwu yaba loni, kwe ayoleho, kwe Omaku; Awofarisi ke kyogwu awo mani kpiri mo, ababa.) <verse eid="ACT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Ebeni egba ngmo ngmo nyiso loshu, kweyi ashini kawofono ni bikpo kawo Ofarisi ni nyiso batawashu kamo aha mojije labi ni ongo mani ya ni lo! Ogege yawo Omaku kwe ayoleho kela danu kokwokwoshi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Awashu oni loshu, kweyi oshi kwo oteyi kawadakare ela koni obayo Obulus yasha ni, oka dawadakare mo, ana sa ga yo Obulus ngma koshu shebe ni, kweyi byo gebe ko bagye kawadakare.<verse eid="ACT 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Otu ke eno ni, Adole hagye bo Obulus eyi kweyi kamo, &lt;&lt;Kayoshi lo! Owolobene hin Ojerusele kweyi okiya yolobene hin Oroma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Agbela koyo Obulus Ngmo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Ni ebenya otukpokyi ashini kikpo kawo Oyahuda gbayi kweyi gbela. Agbela mo owoni ayo Obulus ngmo lo, awa ba roza kwe gwinyi lo di iyiwa enegwa mo, awa ba roza kwe ba gwinyi lo. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Awase ni gbela mani shase awene. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Ebeni aki webe kawosapa nyakwu kpa anyakwase kweyi kamo, &lt;&lt;Aha gbayi kweyi gwene mo owoni aha yo Obulus ngmo lalo aha ba rojije lo. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Nabani, awo kpo onongbo kado oteyi kawadakare Oroma mana byo Obulus wa dala mala ba yimu ko pwokwokwoshi bwo okwunu nu. Aha ke ba yongmo owe ome ona febe ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Oyi ko oyene ko Obulus nongo ke pwoza ni aba gbo ni; oga gebe ko bagye kawadakare kweyi ga kado Obulus.<verse eid="ACT 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Ebeni Obulus ya anyakwase kawadakare oye ogwu kweyi kamo, &lt;&lt;Byisongo mani gebe ko oteyi kawadakare; ogboje ko ka danu. <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Adakare mani byo ga, ebe ni okamo, &lt;&lt;Obulus ni yoruduru ni yumogwu gebe nu kweyi bun mona byisongo mani webe wo, ikweyi koni ogbela koka kpa awo.<verse eid="ACT 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Oteyi kawadakare, byo abo kweyi byo go okoka kweyi doka mo, &lt;&lt;Oji ni ogbo ko kadami?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Kweyi okamo, &lt;&lt;Awose ko Oyahuda kyogwu mo enokyi Aba yimu shini obyo Obulus gebe wa mo onongbo ba yimu ko pwo kwokwoshi bwo okwunu. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Awo ke ka kyogwu dawa lo, awa ni teba ba webe nu ni shango awene ba teba owe. Agwene mo owoni ayo Obulus ngmo lo, awaba roza kwe ba gwinyi lo. Anani akwobonu wiyiwashu ba gbeyi koza ni oya ka ni.<verse eid="ACT 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Oteyi kawadakare kamo, &lt;&lt;Ka kada ashishe mo okpela mani shun lo.&gt;&gt; Kweyi oyisongo mani ganu.<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abyo Obulus Gebe ko Ofelisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Ebeni oteyi kawadakare ya adakare nu epa ogwu, kweyi kamo, &lt;&lt;Ga kpa adakare ogbogbo epa, shini ala wiyikalashu ko go Okesariya kpa awosonya awahapa kpa awo byokpa ogbogbo epa kweyi ana wiyiwashu nyiso ogye ahane kotu mani. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Kweyi dawo nya, ni Obulus yase ni ala byo gebe ko Ofelis ogbolamaga. <verse eid="ACT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Oteyi kadakare tokpa mo:<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />&lt;&lt;Ami Okladiya Olisiyas ta gebe ko Ogbolamaga, Ofelis: Nto ogbogba.<verse eid="ACT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Ase ko Oyahuda yongo mani kwu kweyi aba yimu koyo ngmo. Ishini npwo mo ongo mani bwo Oroma ni nkpadakare hin gayo ngma. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Aha gboso shini ahan gyoza ni oya ni ayokwu ni, nbyo wa gipu ko onongbo. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Ngye mo oyo ojije ni shu koyo ngmo ni lo kwe yo shetu ni lo. Ela ni agboso ni woka doda ikweyi ko ono wa la. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Ishini aka dami mo aba gbela koyo ngmo ni. Nka dawase ni kwo ni mana koza ni oya ni obutu hin.<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Ebeni awa Adakare byoni odawoko ni, akwo Obulus abyo dotuye ga Antipatris. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Ni, ebenya ni, ashawa Adakare konya bita mo, ana ga kpanu, kweyi akwikye wa ka dawa: <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Ishini awadakare, wo Okesariya ni, awa kyoleho dogbolamaga, abyo Obulus wo obutu nu. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Ebeni, ishini ogbolamaga mena ni, odoka mo, obwebenya? Kweyi ishini owa gye mo, obwo Okilikiya la ni, <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />okamo &lt;&lt;Nyya pwela ni ogbo ko ka ni, ishini awo gbapwo kpawo wa.&gt;&gt; Ebeni odawo ko mo, ana byo go ole kose Ohiridus na yagye.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s">Ase ko Oyahuda Kwo Obulus Epwo obutu ko Ofelis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Itikpi keno eho Ananiya Oteyi kawosapa go Okeseriya kpa anyakwase kpa awokepwo ni aba yuwogwu mo Otetulus. Awebe ko ogbolamaga ga kotu kela wa ikweyi ko Obulus. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Ayo Obulus ogwu wa, kweyi Otetulus kyogwu kwotu kela nu aka ikweyi ko Obulus kamo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:2">&lt;&lt;Oshu wo ni ogbo ni yaha gege ko bagye mene, Kweyi oziyi wo yawoza ni yishi ni pya woza neshi. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />Ozani aba yimu ebe wo ishi kpiri ni oma, aba shotunehe dawo Ofelis kpo oza ni oya ya ni. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Nyya yimu ko ngmishi gebe lenu lo, nke bo shini oya akpaha daha kishi gbayayikweyi koza ni aha ba ka ni. <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Aha mo ongo mani owino tela ohobu, okwotu ko tonu ipu kawo Oyahuda ebebenya ese mani kpiri kweyi anu pini woteyi kawase ko Onazaret. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />Mamani oya takirikwu ko yo Ole ko Owuso yishi, ebe ni aha yokwu. <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />Aha ba yimu ko kwepwo byoni ono kaha ka ni Olisiyas ke wayo nye shaha. <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />Owoni odo ongo mani oka abiyo ome oyagye mela ni aba ka ni wokwokwoshi la.<verse eid="ACT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Awanyakwase ko Oyahuda ke kyogwu mela ni aka wokwokwoshi.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Obulus Nyepwo Kiyinu Obutu ko Ofelis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Ebeni ogbolamaga do Obulus abo ko kela kweyi Obulus kamo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:10">&lt;&lt;Ngye moya kepwo kokpagye mani gbeji wa, nshotunehe no dami oshu ko nyepwo kiyun obutu wo. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Doka shini opwo, osheno igwepa walo ni nggo Ojerusele koga geyagye ni. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Awase ko Oyahuda mun ya tawashu kpa ashishe ipu kole ko Owuso, kwe amun ya tase onu ebibye, kwi ipu kekpa kwe ebye ipu ko ogya. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Aba gege ko kadawo oza ni nyya ni lo. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Nkyogwu ko mani kamo: nkyogwu kpo Owuso ka awa Ada ka bwebe ko gbosowe mani ni amo owo okame. Ami ke kyogwu kpo Ono ni ata okpa ko Omusa kpo okpa ni gbela kawinobane. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />Mani oni, nyyotu hin so Owuso, byoni awase mani abiyiwa gboni, mo onyiso ikwu yaba kase neshi kpase bibi. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Mani oni nyya takirikwu ishi kpiri ko yotu ko Owuso kpa asuse na sha.<verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />Itikpi kashayi nwashika ni nbose Ojerusele ni, ngebe ni ko ga byi ikwiri ko da awoleha kpo zeshi do Owuso. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Ishini nyya yawoza mani pini amun ipu kekpa ishini ngmeyi kodu ko nikpiye kweyi ni. Ewa kwe egba ngmongmo yebeni lo <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Ase ko Oyahuda ni bwo okpagye ka Asiya ni bebeni; awa abiyiwa nawa ka dawo owoni agbela oye kpa mi. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Kwe, awa ni bebeni ni na koza ni nyya ni ishini nyyohobu ka awonongbo <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />Oka wegba ni ngmo ishi ni nyyo obutu konongbo ni lo: &lt;Ozani nka ni wela ko nyiso bwi ikwu ni nkyogwu mo awokwu ba nyiso kpo olayi oza ni ya ni aba kwume obutu wo ikyeni ni oma.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Kweyi Ofelis ni gbogyogye nwashika ngmeyi kela mani mo, Ishini oteyi Olisiyas wa nyya ka dawa mo, &lt;&lt;Nyya kepwo kala mani, ogbepwo kwe ogbepwo lo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Ebeni odadakare oko mo, ana yiyi kwo, ana rabo danu kweyi shawo yanu bita na byoza ni oya yimu ni wa danu.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Obulus Obutu ko Ofelisi kpo Odurusila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Itikpi ke eno gbayayi Ofelis wa kponya nu Odurusila ni wase ko Oyahuda ni. Otoleho mo Obulus nawa shini ona pwela nu ni oyaka ikweyi kotuse ipu ko Okristi Oyesu ni. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Obulus ke ya kela ikweyi koneshi kpo gbiyo kpeno ko kepwo kese, Ofelis yoshi kweyi ya kamo, &lt;&lt;Anani gawo, owoni ngbishi nyya yogwu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Ebeni oyotuse mo Obulus ya danu ikwiri; oza ni yani oya yogwu mona wa kela kpanu ni yoma, ikweyi koma ni oya yogwu kurutu wa kela kpanu.<verse eid="ACT 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Itikpi kishayi epa ni shigbo ni, Oposiyos Ofestus wa wo ogbolamaga. Ofelis ya yimu ko shase ko Oyahuda otu, oza ni yani osho Obulus bita oruduru ni oma.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s">Obulus Bo Ogbolamaga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Itikpi keneta ni Ofestus sa okpagye ko Okesariya ogo Ojerusele, <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />ebe ni awosapa nyakwu kpa anyakwase kawo Oyahuda wa kela danu ikweyi ko bibi ni Obulus yani. Kweyi abo Ofestu <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />mona tuwabo shini Obulus na wo Ojerusele, ikweyi koni gbo koyo ngmo owe ni. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Ofestus kamo, &lt;&lt;Obulus yoruduru Okesariya, oya gbeji lo ami abiyun ya gebe ni. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Ala shawa anyakwase kala bita na go Okeseriya kpami naga byo goda kepwo owoni oyozalabi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Ofestu ga yeno ahata kwi igwo kpawa ome ogo Okesariya. Gbebenya oga yagye oda kepwo kweyi omana byo Obulus wipu. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Ishini Obulus webeni ni, awo Oyahuda ni wa bwo Ojerusele wa ni wa hagye bo, kweyi akamo ogbepwo nwashika, ake gbolobene oyoye ko biwa ikweyi ko Obulus lo.<verse eid="ACT 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Obulus ke nyepwo kiyinu: &lt;&lt;Nyyojije labi ikweyi ko ono ko Oyahuda kwe Ole ko Owuso kwe Ogbolamaga ko Oroma lo.&gt;&gt; okela ko miyinu ni, kwe ikweyi ko ono ko Ase ko Oyahuda, kweyi ko ono ko Owuso, kwe ikweyi ko Okesa, nyyoje labi lo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Ofestus ke ya yimu ko sho ase ko Oyahuda otu, ebe ni okado Obulus mo, &lt;&lt;Ogbimu kogo Ojerusele shini ana kwepwo iyi hin ebe ni?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Obulus kamo, &lt;&lt;Nhagye obutu ko oda ko kepwo ko Ogbolamaga, ebe ni ashu ko kwumepwo ni. Nyya ase ko Oyahuda ojije labi lo, byoni awo abiyo gyeni. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Owoni nyyo ono kyigbo kwe nyyoje ni ashu ko yun ngmo ni, nyya tela ko gekwu lo. Owoni okwokwoshi ke yaba ipu kela ni abun mani lo, ashishe ya yun nabo dawa lo, nyya ba mo ogbolamaga ko Oroma na kepwo hin.<verse eid="ACT 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Itikpi ni Ofestus yakpaha kwa awo danela ni, okado Obulus mo, &lt;&lt;Okwobonu byela wo gebe ko Ogbolamaga wa, ebe ko Ogbolamaga pini oya ga la.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Obulus Obutu ka Agripa kpo Obanisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Itikpi kaweno gbayayi, ose Agripa kpo Obanisi wo Okesariya ko Ofestus ko togbogba. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Ishini abebeni ke eno nwashika ni, Ofestus kado ose ela ikweyi ko Obulus, okamo: &lt;&lt;Ongo oye yebe ni ba ni Ofelis yo shetu ni; <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />kweyi nggo Ojerusele, awosapa nyakwu kpa anyakwase kawo Oyahuda kela labi ikweyi ko Obulus kweyi aka dami mo na dawoshu koyo ngmo.<verse eid="ACT 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Nke kadawa mo aha ase ko Oroma gbo odu aba kwase ni amo yozalabi ni epwo lo owoni akela iyi kpiyi kpawase ni shepwo kela ikweyi nu ni kweyi danebe ko nyepwo kiyinu ikweyi kela wa la lo. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Ishini awa gbayi ebeni ni, ngmishi lo, gbebenya ke ngga yagye oda ko kepwo kweyi toleho mana byo wa dami. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Ishini awo byo woda kepwo nyiso ko kela ni, akoza labi oyoye ni nma bya aba ka ikweyi nu ni lo. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Ozani aba gege ya ka ni wa awashu ni ata ikweyi ko ono wa kpo ongo ni aba yogwu mo Oyesu ni gekwu ni; Obulus kamo onyiso bwikwu. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Ngyoza ni nyya ya ko pwela mani neshi ni lo. Ebeni ndo Obulus oka kwe ogbimu ko go Ojerusele shini ana kepwo mani iyi hin? <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Obulus ba mo ana shanu bita oruduru; gbishini Ogbolamaga ko Oroma nawa kepwo nu. Itikpi kela mani ndawoko mana yoruduru gbishini nyya byo ga do Ogbolamaga ko Oroma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Ni olemani oni Agripa kado Ofestus mo, &lt;&lt;Ngbimu ko pwela ni ongo mani ya ka ni akpaha hin.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 25:22">Ofestus kyogwu mo, &lt;&lt;Oya pwela nu okyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Gbebenya Agripa kpo Obanisi wa ba gwakya. Aga bebe ko kepwo ko oteyi kadakare kpa anyakwase ko ogya. Ofestus toleho mana byo Obulus wa. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Ofestus kamo, ose Agripa kpase bebeni kpiri; mo ongo mani ni ase ko Oyahuda ni bebeni ki kpawase ni bo Ojerusele byela wa dami ikweyi nu. Angmegba mo oshu ko yiyi ke lo. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Ami ke mojije ni oya ko gekwu ni lo. Ni anu abiyinu pini bo Ogbolamaga ko Oroma mona kepwo la ni nyya sabo go Oroma. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Ami ke gbojije neshi kota ikweyi nu ga do Ogbolamaga ko Oroma lo. Ni olemani, byo webe ni obutu kala, tata wa awose Agripa owoni akikpo kela kweyi agyoza ni oya ni, nyya gboje kota ikweyi nu. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Ikweyi koni oya shoshi ko byase ni ayoto oruduru ga do Ogbolamaga ko Oroma kweyi koza ni oya ome ayo shetu ni lo.<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s">Obulus Nyepwo Kiyinu Obutu ka Agiripa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Agripa kado Obulus mo, &lt;&lt;ndawoshu ko kela okwunu kiyo ebeni.&gt;&gt; Mani oni Obulus zabo iso kweyi nyepwo kiyinu mo:<verse eid="ACT 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />&lt;&lt;Eshi wo na yo gbogbo Ose Agripa! Nshotunehe ni ikyeni nyya nyepwo kiyu hin obutu wo ikweyi koza kpiri ni awase ko Oyahuda mani ba ka ikweyi hin ni, <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />nshotunehe ni awo gyodu kase ko Oyahuda kpiri kpawashu wa ni. Nyya bo mo zakpaha dami kpotumene.<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />Kpiri kase ko Oyahuda gyoyagye hin bwishi ni nwwisongo ni. Agyoza ni nyya ipu koyagye hin kpiri ni, bwokpagye hin ikyikyo ome Ojerusele. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Agye gyun kpiri, owoni aba kyogwu ko yolobene, kikyikyo nyyipu kikpo ni loshu shoshe ipu ko owe kaha ni, ikpo ka Awofarisi. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Kweyi anani nhagye koni aba kumepwo ikweyi koni nyyotu so okoyi ni Owuso she dawada kaha ni. <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Omani pini wokoyi ni ose igwepa kase kaha ba yiyitagye ko wa nye, byoni aba geyagye do Owuso ke eno kotu ni. Abaga-edu, ikweyi kiyitagye mani pini ase ko Oyahuda mani ba kwumepwo ma! <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Ala ni bebeni mani, ojiya ni olono dawa ko kyogwu mo Owuso ya yase ni gekwu ni ya nyiso?<verse eid="ACT 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />&lt;&lt;Ami abiyun mamo nshu ko yojoji ni nyya gege ya ni shina wobi kela ko Oyesu ko Onazaret. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Ozani nyya Ojerusele ni oma. Npyoshu bwebe ka awosapa nyakwu kweyi kwase ko Owuso nwashika shoruduru; kweyi ishini aba kela ko yuwa ngmo ni, nwwoye ipu kawase ni tabo ni. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Ishi nwashika ndawowe ipu kawekpa kweyi takirikwu ko yuwa na shotuse wa bita. Otu hin bya kpawa gbishini ngga wo ogya nyakwu ko ga dawegye.<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Obulus Gbigwu Kipya Nu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />Ozani byun ya go Odamasko ni oma, awosapa nyakwu damoshu ki tumoleho. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Abaga-edu! Nyyikweyi ko owe isheno nmola ni ya yu sheno ni bwokpowuso ya yu webe hin kpawase ni yawu kpami ni. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Kpiri kaha gbo okpagye, kweyi npwoko ya yumo gwu okwunu ki Ibru mo, &lt;&lt;Oshawulu, Oshawulu! Ojiya noya damegye? Oya diyo egye byo onya ni ya tela ko okposhi ka Adole nu ni.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />Ndoka mo, &lt;&lt;Awo wanoho, Adole? Ebeni Adole kyogwu mo, &lt;&lt;Ami Oyesu, noya damegye ni. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Nyiso shini ohagye. Nbose dawa ko sho shini owoyole hin. Oya kela koza ni oma ebe hin ikyeni kpoza ni nyya wa shawo ohobu ni. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Nyya ngmawo shabo kase ki Izrayila kpawase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni nyya toleho ebe wa ni. <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />Oya gwawiyi kweyi pyawa bwebe dibu webe yoyu ki bwoshu ki Ibiri gebe ko Owuso, shini bwebe ko totu sun wa ana yozalabi wa gbuwa kweyi aba zebe ko yagye wa ipu kase ko Owuso.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />Ni olemani oni Ose, Agripa, ntela ko yoko kpoza ni agwamiyi ma bwi iso ni lo. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />Ntono dase wotiri shini ase na shagbotu kozalabi wa kweyi kwikye gobutu ko Owuso kweyi yoza ni ya sayi mo ashagbotu ni, kikyikyo ipu ko Odamasko, kpo Ojerusele, kpokpagye ki Izrayila kpiri, kpokpagye kawase ni wase ko Oyahudiya lo ni. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Ozani ya nase ko Oyahuda mani yun kwu ipu kole ko Owuso oma, kweyi atakirikwu ko yun ngmo. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Owuso ke yipu ko tumabo bwishi oni wikyeni, mani oni nhagye ebe ni ya yolobene dananoho, kayeke kanyakwase. Ozani nyya ka ni woye kponu kpoza ni awobane kpo Omusa kamo oya wa gbodagye ni: <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />mo, Omezaya yawa mowe, kweyi ya wa kikyikyo ko nyiso ikwu, ko tono koyoyu mo Owuso ya ngmase, kase ko Oyahuda kase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Ni Obulus ya nyepwo kiyinu ni, Ofestus kyaneha mo, &lt;&lt;Oya nyoza, Obulus! Ozagyogye nwashika yo ya nyoza.<verse eid="ACT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Obulus kyogwu mo, &lt;&lt;Abaga-edu! Nnyoza lo, Nyya kela kokwokwoshi ni gbikweyi ni la. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Abaga-edu Ose Agripa! Nyya kela dawo gboshi lo, ikweyi koni ngye mawo gyawoza mani kpiri. Ngye kamo awoza mani kpiri bipu kotu wo, ikweyi koni agbodagye ebe teba la lo. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Ose Agripa awo kyogwu kpawobane? Ngye mokyogwu kpawa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Agripa kado Obulus mo, &lt;&lt;Oma moya gege ya yun ya wino gboso Oyesu ipu kishi gbayayi mani?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Obulus kamo, &lt;&lt;Ko wishi gbayayi ko wishi nwashika, Nyya bo Owuso mawo kpashini kala ni ba pwun ikyeni ni ala wa woza ni nwwe ni, oza ni nyya yimu shala ka we lo ni wa ko kwala shetu byami mani!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Ni oka mani ni, ose kpo ogbolamaga kpo Obanisi, kpase ashini kpiri takpa nyiso, <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />Abose wa, ba ka diyiwa mo, &lt;&lt;Ongo mani yojije ko yo ngmo kwako byo go oruduru lo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Kweyi Ose Agripa kado Ofestus mo, &lt;&lt;Ongo mani bi kwobonu byela nu gebe ko Okesa la lo, abi ba shobita.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s">Obulus Sheyi ki Ishu go Oroma.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Ishini agbo mo ahan sheyi ki ishu gi Itali ni, ayo Obulus kpa ashini kase bo oruduru ni abyuwa ga do oteyi kawadakare ogbogbo oye ko Oroma, iye nu wo Ojiliyos. <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Agipu ko owu nyakwu ka Adramutum, ni yokwunu ega okpagye ka Asiya. Ashe iyenu wo Aristakus bwo Otasalonika okpagye ko Omasedoniya yo kpaha. <verse eid="ACT 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Gbebenya aha go Osido. Ebeni Ojiliyos yo Obulus oza neshi, oshobita mo na gebe kawoya nu, shini adanu oza ni oyayimu ni. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Aha nyiso bwebe ni, ikweyi aha ba ga gbabo ni owu yata bwanu ni, aha pya bweji ko Osipros ebe ni owu shashi ni. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Ebeni aha sheyi ki ishu ko Okilikiya kpo Opamfiliya go Omira okpagye ko Olisiya. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Ishini afebe ni oteyi ka adakare pyo owu ka Alegzandiriya ni ya gi Itali ni kweyi okpaha shipu nu. <verse eid="ACT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Aha powu myomyo ke eno nwashika arikya ome aha fogya ko Osinidus la. Owu yaha gohobu ke lo, ebe ni aha pya bweji ko Okrete ebe ni owu shashi ni, asheyi kega ko Osamone. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Aha powu bwashikwu kega kinyo ebe ni atakirikwu aha wa bwebe ni aba yogwu mega ko gbowu. Bwebe ni go ogya ko Olasiya lenu lo.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Aha ngmishi nwashika ebe ni, gbishini aba gege ko powu gohobu kelo, ikweyi koni owe eno ko rimya ko yigbase shigbo. Ebeni Obulus kela dawa mo; <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />ango nmabyo iyawu ka ya shoshi lo bwebe mani gohobu. Ebi yawa towu kaha kpiyo kaha kweyi ashini ka nwashika kiba ba gekwu mamani. <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Oshi ke yo oteyi kadakare kwu kweyi kyogwu kpela kine kowu kpino powu, otela ko pwoza ni Obulus kani. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Koni ebe ni owu ba hagye ni shoshi ko yagye ishi ni owu yata ni lo. Ase nwashika wa kyogwu mana ga shini ana fega ki ishu ko Ofoniksi owoni aba gege, shini ana bebeni ishi ni owu wa tani. Ofoniksi wega ni yo Okrete ni pyiyi tekye kpi ikpokyi.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Owu loshu ipu Ki Ishu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Owu ke kye ni yata myo ni kwotu ko tota, awase mani mana gohobu kpi iyawu wa, Kweyi aga yogye ni kwagye ni shu, kweyi powu sheyi gokwunu kega ko Okrete. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Oke gbeji lo, owu bibi yiso kpawa aba yogu mo, &lt;&lt;Ikpokyi ka ahanokyi,&gt;&gt; ota gebe ni inyo shogba to ni. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Ishini oyowu kwu ni, ogege ko powu kele, kweyi aha shobita danu. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Afebe ni owu ba hagye ni ebeni aga bwu ge ekye agye ni inyo shogba to gbayayi ni Okawuda. Ebeni amowe ake takirikwu ko yowu leke ni agbo itikpi kowu mani na ka kya lo. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Ishini abyo owu leke wipu kowu nyakwu ni, agbogwa gyehe to owu kinyo bweye nu. Ayoshi ela koni oya gbo ipu kisisagye ni yega ko Olibiya ni, aya ayikyi kowu kinyo sa shini owu na to owu kinyo ga. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Ebeni, owu loshu-loshu ni gohobu ko tota, gbebenya akpiyo shonu bwipu ko owu, <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Eno komweta akpiyo ashini ni wa ko owu ni shipu kinyo. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Mani oni, eno nwashika aha meno kwe inyiwo bose lo, owu ke yipu ko tota loshu-loshu. Agbotu maba bose kelo. <verse eid="ACT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Itikpi koni agebe lenu gboza rore lo ni, Obulus yiso hagye otutehe wa kweyi kamo, &lt;&lt;Ala bi pwela hin abi powu bwo Okrete lo; ebi ni tala mani byi ya taha lo. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Anani nke ya bala, azotu! Ashishe kala ya gekwu lo; owu kin pini kyala. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Ikweyi koni otu kene oyoleho ko Owuso ni nyya gboso ni nyya geyagye danu ni hagye agbabo hin <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />kweyi Kamo, &lt;Obulus! Ka yoshi lo, oya hagye obutu ko ogbolamaga. Kweyi Owuso ipu ko neshi nu ikweyi wo oya ngmawase ni bipu ko owu kpawo ni.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Ni olemani, Ayene hin, ala zotu! Ikweyi koni nkyogwu kpo Owuso ni, oya le byo ni nka dami ni. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Oke ya wotiri daha shini owu na taha ga bwokpagye okwunu kinyo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Otu ke eno komigwene yoma nowu ya taha ipu ki ishu ko Omeditaraniya ni. Otutehe kotu awopowu ma byo fokwunu kega wa. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Mani oni ayoza lenu gbogwa kweyi yi ta gipu kinyo, ebe ni agye mo libwu kinyo mani wikpo ogbogbo oye sawepa; azishi gbayayi aki ya mamani, kweyi owikpo awahane. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Ayoshi ela koni aba ga gokpo ni, asa awogye lenu ene abo geye itikpi kowu kweyi aba tinarigwu shini ebe na nya. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Ebeni awopowu ba yimu ko bose wa shipu ko owu; asowu leke ipu kinyo byaba yimu ko ki sawogye lenu oye geye kinyo ohobu kowu oni. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Obulus ke kado oteyi kadakare kpa awadakare mo, &lt;&lt;Owoni opowu gyelo yagye ipu kowu lo, ala ka yotuse mala ba bose lo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Mani oni, awadakare yogwa kowu leke ni she kweyi yo owu pe ganu.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Ome ebenya, Obulus buwa kpiri mana roza: &lt;&lt;Ala bebe mani eno igwene pi yoma, kpiri kishi mani ala rojije lo ni. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Mani oni nyya bala, mala roza; shini ala gbolayi. Kwinyeyi kashe kala oye ya gebi lo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Ishini okela mani kweyi ni, Obulus zikyoga, kweyi keshi ko Owuso obutu wa kpiri, ofa, kweyi kwotu ko ha. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Ebeni ikpiye wa loshu, kweyi kpiri wa roza. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Kpiri kaha ni bowu ni wo 276 ogbogbo epa sawahapa ayihiri. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Ishini kpiri kananoho hoza yipu ni, akpi izire kpiri ni yipu kowu ni shonu gipu ki ishu shini enu na shashi.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Owu Kya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Ishini ebenya ni, opowu gyo okwunu kega lo, ake magye oye kweyi anonu powu gebe ni owoni aba gege ya hagye. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Mani oni ayogye lenu kowu she gipu kinyo, mamani aki yogwa ni bye ese kowu ni yiyi. Kweyi ayaki kohobu kowu yigwa shini owu na towu gohobu, ebe ni apyogo kowu tega ki ishu. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Owu ke wa gweji kokpagye kweyi gohobu; ogo kowu lagye kweyi ogege ko yawu lo, Kweyi ogwa kinyo yitikpi kowu kya.<verse eid="ACT 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Awadakare gbo ko yawo bo oruduru ngmo kpiri, shini anaka tagwa sheyi kega kweyi nyinya wa. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Oteyi kawadakare ke yimu koyo Obulus ngma, kweyi omana ka yamani lo. Ebeni Okadawa mo aseni gishi ko tagwa ona shibi ikyikyo kweyi na tagwa gega; <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />ashini na yabo byo okyokya kowu, oza ni gbodagye ome anano kaha sheyi gega ni oma.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s1">Agye ko Omolta:</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Naha sa neshi ega kishu ni, apwo miye kokpagye ninyo shogba to ni wo Omolta. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Awase kebe ni yahoza neshi nwashika. Owuso kwotu ko yiwo kweyi oshu ya ya, ebe ni agwola kweyi yahomaba kpiri kaha. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Obulus kpayabo kefu tukpa kweyi kpuwa shola, ebe ni egwa bose koni ebe ya dola kweyi wa lo Obulus abo. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Awase kebe ninyo shogba toni ma ni egwa lo Obulus abo ni, aka diyiwa mo, &lt;&lt;Ogbawashu lo, ongo mani wino ngmase la, obose bwikwu ki ishu, kwikyikyeni Owuso nase ba gboso mani ya shobita kpolayi lo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Ebeni Obulus myabo, egwa gbo gola, ojije ke yo lo kpiri-kpiri. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Ase kpiyi shagye ko mo ya myi kwako gbo gekwu. Ni ake kpiyi shagye gbeji kweyi amojije yo lo ni, apyokwunu kamo, &lt;&lt;Obulus wo owuso la!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Ishini oza mani gbogagye kpo Obulus ni, ebe ni okpagye shini wako Opubliyos lenu lo, anu ni woteyi kokpagye ninyo shogba to ni, oyahomaba neshi kweyi awogboga nu keno eta. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Ada ko Opubliyos gbotagye ikweyi ko gwudu, oshu kwo kweyi oya shipu. Obulus gipu nu koda nu, yabo so kweyi otinarigwu, kweyi danu gege kikpiye nu. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Ni oza mani gbodagye ni, ashini kawine kere kpiri ni bokpagye ninyo shogba tuwa ni wa kweyi odawo gege kikpiye wa. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Ayaheshi nwashika, kweyi ishini aha gipu ko owu ko sheyi kinyo ni, adahoza kpiri naba doka ipu kiyawu kaha ni.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bwo Omolta go Oroma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Itikpi koya eta aha sheyi kpowu bwa Alegzandiriya, ni aba yogwu mo &lt;&lt;Apule Ka Owuso ni,&gt;&gt; ni minyo nu ishi ko owu ebe ni inyo shogba to ni. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Aha fo ogya ko Osirakus, kweyi aha bagye eneta ebe ni. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Bwebe ni, aha gohobu ipu kinyo ka sa ogya ko Orejiyom. Gbebenya, owu kwotu ko ta bwagbabo kekye, ipu ke eno epa aha fo ogya ko Oputiyoli. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Amawogboso Oyesu ebe ni kweyi amaha an bagye kpawa kobize oye. Mani oni aha wo Oroma. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Awogboso Oyesu ko Oroma pwoshu kaha kweyi ase wa bwawogya lenu-lenu, ase bwi Ipishi ka Apiyo kpa Ase Eta bwo Ole kawogboga wa taha. Ni Obulus muwa ni, ogbede shi ko Owuso kweyi opyotugbagba.<verse eid="ACT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ipu ko Oroma.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Ishini, aha sa Oroma ni, asho Obulus bita yagye abo kiyinu kpadakare oye ya gbeho nu.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Itikpi keneta, Obulus yanyakwase kase ko Oyahuda ogwu gbayi. Ishini awa gbayi ni, oka dawa mo, &lt;&lt;Ayene hin ki Izrayila, nyyase kaha ojije lo nke yodu oyoye ni awokyikyi kaha nabo daha ni kyigbo lo, kwikyikyeni ayun toruduru Ojerusele kweyi yun nabo dase ko Oroma. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Ishini adumoka ni, ase ko Oroma yimu ko shunbita, ikweyi koni akwun kpobibi oyoye ni gye ko yun ngmo ni lo. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Awase ko Oyahuda ke kyogwu lo, gbishini owotiri dami ko kpela sho Ogbolamaga, oke wa koni nyya kwagye kepwo kpawase hin lalo. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Ozani ya ni amo nawa mala nakyi kela kpala ni yoma. Ela kokwokwoshi, ashuma ashirika mani ikweyi ko Omezaya ni ase ki Izrayila kpiri kpiyi shagye ikweyi nu ni.<verse eid="ACT 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Aka danu mo, &lt;&lt;Aha pyokpa oyoye bwo Oyahudiya ikweyi wo lo, ashishe ipu kawase kaha bwanoni wa kpela oyoye ikweyi wo lo, ake koje bibi ikweyi wo lo. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Aha ke ba yimu ko pwowushoshu wo, ikweyi koni asuse ebebenya ba kela labi ikweyi kikpo no yipu nu mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Mani oni ado Obulus eno, kweyi eno oni ase nwashika wa gbayi ebe ni Obulus yanu ni. Bwohoki go otu ogwikweyi kela nu dawa ikweyi ko obula ko Owuso, kweyi otakirikwu ko yuwa na zela ko Oyesu bwebe ko shiyawa bwipu ko Ono ko Omusa kpenena kawobane. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Ashini wa kyogwu kpela ni oka dawa ni, ashini wa ke kyogwu lo. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />No Obulus ke koje kponu mani, ashebe ni bita, ba tawashu kpiyiwa. Ozani oka ni yoma: &lt;&lt;Omaku ko Owuso kela kwokwoshi dawokyikyi kala! Bwebe kinobane Ishaya. <verse eid="ACT 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />Ikweyi koni Okamo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">&lt;Ga ka dawase mani mo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">Ala ba zakpaha gbogbo, ala ke ba gyikweyi nu lo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:26">Ala ba mebe gbogbo, ala ke ba ma lo,<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Koni otu kawasuse mani labi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">Kweyi ayakpaha wa du</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">ki yiyi wa gwu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Olemani lalo iyi wa biya ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">akpaha wa bi ya pwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">otu wa bi ya gyikweyi nu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Owuso kamo, kweyi abi ba kwikye webe hin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">Ami bi ya dawo gege.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Mani oni, Obulus ngmeyi kela mo: &lt;&lt;Nyya yimu shala gye mo akwobonu toleho koshu ko ngmongma ko Owuso gebe kawase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni wa. Kweyi Ake ba zakpaha danu!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />Itikpi koni Obulus kela mani, Awoyahuda gawa, atawashu kotata kpiyi wa.<verse eid="ACT 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Ebeni Obulus yagye ole ni oze kikwiri diyinu ni kashayi epa, kweyi ya zawase kpiri ni bawa kowa mo ni. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Otono ikweyi ko obula ko Owuso kweyi ya fasoza ikweyi ka Adole Oyesu Okristi, ya kela gboshi yoya lo ashishe ke wobi lo.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>